Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:07.40,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\pos(260,236)\b0}公元2054年  尼福尔海姆星球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,想不到我竟然还活着?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How did I survive that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这一摔可不轻\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It was some damn fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.49,0:01:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我的通讯设备坏了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, shit. My comm's busted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.25,0:01:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,保暖装置也坏了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}My thermal's busted too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.79,0:01:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我宁愿在刚才落到一半时 撞死在石头上\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I should have got snapped in half and died on the way down,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也不愿意在这里被慢慢冻成一根肉冰棍\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}instead of slowly turning into a meat popsicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,提莫?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Timo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.35,0:01:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Timo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,提莫 我在这里呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Timo, I'm down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Timo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,提... 提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}T-- Timo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 提莫 我在这里呢 - 米奇 哇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Timo, I'm down here. - Mickey. Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然没死?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You haven't died yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.42,0:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 等一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- No. - Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.75,0:02:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你的爆燃枪都没坏\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Your flamethrower's still good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,连道划痕都没有\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Not a single scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还好我决定下来看看\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's a good thing I thought to come down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这下武器部可开心了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Weapons will be happy to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以把它交回去吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, I'm gonna turn this in, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,给我就行\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I can take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会生我气吧 我想只带它走\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're not mad, right? That I'm just taking this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟 你看上去状态不大好 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I mean, it's not looking very good for you, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 绳子只有这么长\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Also, line only goes this far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不会 没关系\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, no, we-- we're cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,冒险下来救我不值得\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You shouldn't have to take the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我就是这个意思\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, that's what I'm saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,反正他们明天早晨还会重新打印你的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Plus, they're gonna reprint you back out tomorrow anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,死是种什么滋味啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's it feel like to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.37,0:03:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在肯定是习惯了 不过...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm sure you're used to it by now. Still...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第几次了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How many times is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你是米奇... 16号?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're Mickey... 16?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,17号 混蛋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}17. Jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个是18号\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}18 after this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 很高兴认识你 祝你死得开心\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, it was nice knowing you, have a nice death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,明天见\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}See you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这一只可真不小\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's a pretty big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,希望它可以直接一口把我吞下去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hopefully, I'll just get swallowed in one go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那肯定比一点点冻死要好受多了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's got to be better than slowly freezing to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,应该吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是我想多了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Or maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,每次我死了 他们就会重新把我打印出来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But they just printed me out again every time I died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我的数据都有备份 我只需要一个新身体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All my data is saved, and I just get a whole new body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,除此之外 科学家们还会定期重新上传\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They do all this, kind of, regular uploads of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我的记忆和我的性格特点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}memories and my personality traits...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把它们植入我的新大脑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...and re-implant it back in my brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是一项疯狂的技术 只能说\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's some crazy technology, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,只能说这项技术很先进\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Let's just say it's-- it's advanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,相当先进\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's very advanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 快啊 等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能不能等一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait. Would you just hold on a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 放松 放松 不要紧张\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just like-- Calm down. Calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸 没错 呼吸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just relax, breathe. That's right, breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦  - 漂亮\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Oh! - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,说到身体打印和记忆 移植这一系列操作\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The whole body printing and memory transplanting thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.90,提示,,0,0,0,,(正在上传)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 它过于先进 远远超前于这个时代\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}to be honest, was so ridiculously ahead of its time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因此在社会上造成许多道德争议\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that it caused so many, like, ethical fights{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还有宗教争议之类的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and religious blah, blah, blah,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因此这种技术在地球上是禁止应用的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that it was actually banned on Earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只允许在外太空应用在消耗体身上\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and they only allow it now in outer space for Expendables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,比如我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以从出地球大气层\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, from the second we left the atmosphere,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,到来这个星球的一路上 我一直在拼命工作\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}they made me work my ass off all the way to this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,完成了一个又一个任务\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Gave me one mission after another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,技术部 什么情况 备份电缆已经送到了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, Tech, what's going on? The extra cable's here already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Um, the thing is, Mickey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,医疗部 你们告诉他吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, Medical, you wanna tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Tell me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 你好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hi, Mickey. How're you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有感觉到晕眩 恶心或头晕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are you experiencing any vertigo, nausea or dizziness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像确实感觉头有点晕晕的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, I-I guess I am feeling a little dizzy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.39,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的头晕会逐渐加剧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's only gonna get worse from here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 另外你还会发烧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, with a nice fever too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 你现在暴露在难以想象的辐射水平下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Truth is, you're exposed to unthinkable levels of radiation right now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是我们派你出去的原因\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}which is why we sent you out in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我们详细地描述你的症状\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}If you could give us a full description of your symptoms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我想先过一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, a couple things I wanna go through{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙辐射清单上列出的几点问题\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}on our cosmic radiation checklist first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的皮肤多久会开始灼伤\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How long until your skin starts to burn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 你多久之后会失明\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Then, how long until you go blind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,当然还要看你多久之后会死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And of course, how long until you die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们真正想了解的问题\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's the real nut we're after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在我上四年级的时候 在一节科学课上\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There was this one time in my fourth grade science class,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我恶整了一只实验用青蛙\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I messed with a lab frog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜想这一切肯定是我的报应\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I just figured this all must be my punishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 摘掉你的手套\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, take off your glove,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看到太空服下你身体的变化\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}so I can see what's happening under your space suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看见了吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh! Oh! Wow! Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早上好 - 早上好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Good morning. - Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 你要大量喝水\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Keep yourself hydrated, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你一会儿会感到极度口渴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You'll start to feel extremely parched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,阿卡迪 我认为这剂量太大了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Arkady, I think the dose was too high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:07:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,重要吗 多萝西 他10分钟后就死了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Who cares, Dorothy? He's gonna be dead in ten minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,专心获取血液样本就行了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just focus on getting all the blood samples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他的眼 鼻 口 耳以及直肠都会出血\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's gonna bleed through his eyes, nose, mouth, ears, and rectum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,确保从每个孔窍采集单独样本 好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Make sure to collect separate samples from every hole. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,同时还要持续上传记忆到他的大脑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And keep the memory upload going at the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这个米奇很特别 你懂吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This Mickey's special, you know that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在所有的米奇当中 就你的寿命最短\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Out of all the Mickeys, you will have the shortest lifespan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我听到了 10分钟 - 哦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- I heard. Ten minutes. - Well--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个好消息 应该有15分钟\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Actually, good news, it's more like 15.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好多了 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Much better, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.69,0:08:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本靠买人寿保险\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I would have been filthy rich by now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就可以富到流油\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}with life insurance, except...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过很显然 消耗体不能买保险\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...obviously, Expendables are uninsurable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有工伤保险 加不了工会 没有退休金福利\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There's no workers' comp, no unions, no pension benefits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,说了这么多 不出意外的话你们肯定在想\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now, I wouldn't be surprised if you were thinking at this point,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"那么你何苦跟自己过不去呢"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"Well then, why-- why did you do this to yourself?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这是因为我有个朋友告诉我说\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, because I had a friend who told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,将来 马卡龙会卖得比汉堡还要好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that one day macarons would sell better than burgers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:56.00,提示,,0,0,0,,(马卡龙不是罪)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.05,0:09:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 我居然相信了这个烂朋友的鬼话\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And because I trusted this shitty friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,去找了一个大好人 弄了一笔巨额贷款 来开了一间马卡龙店\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and I got an enormous loan from a wonderful gentleman to open a macaron store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:13.40,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\pos(236,235)\an1\b0}四又三分之一年前  地球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,完了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 好了 安静点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All right, all right, calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们还有四个星期呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm well aware that you have four weeks left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就把这当体验活动吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just think of this as a little field trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看看不能按时向我们偿还欠款的人 下场是什么样的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A taste of what may unfold should you fail to reimburse us in a timely manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 你们两个还有很多时间\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Besides, you two have a lot of time on your hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然说 你们的马卡龙店倒闭了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}with your little macaron shop gone under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们已经... 你们已经表达得非常清楚了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is quite a show you got on here for me, quite a show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,清晰明了 我都懂了 百分之百懂了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The message is clear, I hear you. I hear it loud and clear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还晚了 还晚了 我钱还晚了 我马上还\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"I'm late. I'm late. The money is late."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,差两个人 顶多三个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's coming. Two people behind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,达赖厄斯·布朗克 真希望我从没听过这个名字\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Darius Blank. A name I wish I'd never heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,布朗克先生其实根本就不在意钱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mr. Blank isn't all that concerned with money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.09,0:10:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他有的是钱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He has plenty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这栋楼只是他资产的一部分\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This building's just one of his many assets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看着拖欠债务的借款人去死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Watching his delinquent borrowers die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,细细品味死亡的细节\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}savoring the details of death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.47,0:10:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是真正让他过瘾的事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that, he truly enjoys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经明白 可以停手了 停手吧 好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The message is clear. You can stop now. We can stop, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我明白了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's-- It's... I hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,两周 只要两周 只要再给我两周\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You know, two weeks, two weeks is all it takes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,两周就够了 我可以多给钱 很多很多钱…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All it takes now. A-A-And more is coming, there's more coming, more money is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以多给你很多钱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}More money is, is, is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们四天前在乌兰巴托逮到的他 在蒙古国\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We caught that gentleman four days ago in Ulaanbaatar, Mongolia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看着还挺贵的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Looks expensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,放心好了 只要有人到期不还钱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Rest assured, anyone who misses the deadline,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就会满地球追杀他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}we chase them to the ends of the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我们决定 从地球上逃离\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So we decided to get off of Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:04.50,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs15}(尼福尔海姆任务 你的旅途从此开始)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:08.30,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs14}(尼福尔海姆 优质的居住环境 赶快预定吧 你在纯净星球上的新家)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我在地球上一事无成 也没有家人需要我亲自照顾\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nothing was working out, and I got no family relying on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,于是 我申请了殖民探险\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, I applied to the colony expedition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但还有上百万人也是这个想法\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but there's, like, a million other people with the same idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这整个烂星球上的人都想逃离这里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Seems like the whole of this rotten planet was running away from something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜每个人都面临金钱问题\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I guess everybody's got money problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但无论如何 我们一定要上这艘船\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But anyway, we had to get on this ship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这是本季的最后一艘了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}because it was the last one of the season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一波又一波的人争先恐后地离开地球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Waves upon waves of people desperate to leave Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,由此可见 反移民者们坚持修复我们的地球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's clear anti-migrationists are talking to a brick wall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,反对冒着生命危险\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}when they insist on fixing up the Earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.79,0:11:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,移民至另一个星球的言论 根本就没有人在意\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}instead of risking lives by migrating to another planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这些狂热的申请人看起来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It feels like these passionate applicants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就像已经身处太空一样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}are already off in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,更重要的是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}More importantly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这场远征由前国会议员 肯尼斯·马歇尔带领\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}this is the expedition led by former congressman, Kenneth Marshall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,目前他已经连续两次败选\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}who lost his last two elections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个失败的政客\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Is this failed politician{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.19,0:11:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是想在太空当中建立一个王国吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}now trying to establish a kingdom beyond the stars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,替他争取到慷慨赞助的那些狂热支持者们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Is it his fanatical supporters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是不是来自某个特定的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}who won him a generous sponsorship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,宗教组织或企业\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}from a particular religious organization and corporation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有太多问题等待解答了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So many questions left unanswered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去访问一下公众\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Let's go and talk to the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 你是肯尼斯·马歇尔支持者吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Excuse me, are you a Kenneth Marshall supporter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是 我特别支持\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I am. I am, big time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我全身心地支持他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I am a full-on supporter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可以说我就是独一无二\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I basically am the one and only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来自EC20 - 不是吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- I'm from EC 20-- - No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,所以马歇尔正在收看吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So Marshall's watching this right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 - 你必须选我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Oh, my God! - You need to pick me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.10,0:12:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 一定要选我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I swear, please pick me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要年轻 健康的人加入这场远征\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You need people young and healthy for the expedition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 今天又有一场小型沙尘暴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Ladies and gentlemen, we have another mild sandstorm today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只能由三号门通行\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Access is now restricted to gate three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,请至我们的摊位选购 打折护目镜和口罩\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Please visit our stand for discounted goggles and masks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,使用马歇尔支付享额外九五折 一如既往\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Additional five percent off with Marshall Pay, as always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,别的远征队都拒绝让我加入\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The other expeditions wouldn't take me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但我保证他们错了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but they're wrong, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我会修马桶 我会做姜饼 请一定要带上我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I can fix toilets. I make gingerbread. You gotta take me, give me a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.37,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,带我们去洁净星球吧 马歇尔和伊尔法\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Take us to the clean star, Marshall and Ylfa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,请带上我吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Take me with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:04.10,提示,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs16\pos(17,250)}工作申请表\N{\fs12}姓: 巴恩斯  名: 米奇\N申请岗位: 消耗体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.63,0:13:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,消耗体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Expendable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.01,0:13:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你要申请当消耗体?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're applying to be an Expendable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你认真的吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Seriously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,申请内容仔细看过了吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You read through the whole application?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该看一遍的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I should have read through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我并没有太多选择\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I mean, I didn't have too much of a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有任何受到法律承认的证书\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't have any bona fide certifications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没什么像样的技能\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't really have any skills whatsoever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我发现 提莫已经为自己抢到了一个职位\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Then I find out Timo's already called dibs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等你踏上旅途 飞掠机驾驶员\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}on a position for himself, as a flitter pilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他几周之前才刚刚拿到学习许可证\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He only just got his learner's permit a couple of weeks before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知道这小子到底是怎么做到的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No idea what he had to come up with to pull that off,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不服不行\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but you gotta give it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是在搞装修什么的吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Is there, like, some construction going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sorry, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有听到…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You don't hear like a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,像电锯的声音吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...like a ch-chain saw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我一心只想离开那里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I wanted to get the hell outta there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,到一个能摆脱电锯声的地方\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Somewhere where the sound couldn't follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,到遥远的外太空去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Far out into space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,资料你都读过了吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You read through the paperwork?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你读过了 所以你肯定明白\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You read it, so you know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一份很极端的工作\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is gonna be a pretty extreme job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不过肯定也会很有趣\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But it's also gonna be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我来跟你详细介绍一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'll explain all the details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我的思绪完全被这个女人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I got so distracted by that smell, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个女人的发香带跑了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}the smell of this woman's hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它彷佛勾起了我一些十分遥远的回忆\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It was like it brought back some far away memory, or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,楼下的那个巨大储罐叫做循环站\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That giant tank downstairs is called a cycler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,它会带走宇宙飞船中产生的有机废物\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It takes organic waste produced in the spaceship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,比如苹果皮 鸡骨头 臭鸡蛋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}apple peels, chicken bones, rotten eggs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,人的尸体 排泄物等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}dead bodies, human waste, you name it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,接着它会结合 精炼并回收这些物体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}then it combines, refines, and recycles them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,并把其中一部分输送到这个打印机\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and sends a portion to this printer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,用作打印人体的原物料\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Raw materials for a human body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你死后 且委员会批准后\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Once you die, and the Committee approves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,它就会在20小时内给你打印一个新身体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}it'll print a new version of your body within 20 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的衣服脱掉 换上这一套\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Take your clothes off, change into this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她说的话我一个字都没听进去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I couldn't even hear anything she was saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像我的感官全集中在我的鼻子上了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It was like all of my senses were focused on my nose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是一种似曾相识的气味\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Like, real déjà vu, but for a smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将对你的生物数据进行全面扫描\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We're going to do a full scan of your biodata.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着你每次打印出来都会是这样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That means you'll be reprinted exactly as you are right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个最好挤出来 不然每次都会有它\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I better pop this. Otherwise, it will be there every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还好她不知道我屁股上还有一颗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, I'm glad she didn't know about the one on my butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:46.80,提示,,0,0,0,,(启动扫描模式 载入 运行)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,给我做完全身扫描后\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, after she does the body scan,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她上传了我的记忆 并把它命名为"个性备份"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}she uploaded my memories. Called it a "personality backup."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这我一周就得经历一次\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And I gotta do this once a week,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,以免我每次被打印出来后产生认知差距\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}so I don't have any big gaps every time they print me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.06,0:16:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在过去 需要用一个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}In the past, you would have needed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跟商用冰箱一样大的硬盘\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}a hard drive the size of a commercial refrigerator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,才能复制成年人的大脑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}to copy an adult brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在一块砖就够了 很先进 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now, this little brick. Clever, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她把某种特殊溶液 注射进了我体内\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, I was injected with some special solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.32,0:16:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我的旧记忆大量涌现\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It brought back a flood of old memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大量的记忆\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Too many memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正要离开超市回家\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We were heading home from the supermarket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我闹着非要坐副驾驶\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I asked to sit in the front seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我说我是大孩子了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I said, "I'm big enough."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了那个红色按钮\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And that's when I saw the red button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我按了下去 她就撞车了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I just pressed it and she crashed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,拿它对着脑袋 然后扣扳机\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Put it to your head and pull the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是成为消耗体的最后一项要求\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is the final requirement to become an Expendable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,向我证明你对这个系统有信心\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Prove to me you have faith in the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在起你必须习惯死亡\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}From now on, you need to get used to dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的工作\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我作为米奇1号开启了四年半的旅程\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I began the four-and-a-half year journey as Mickey 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦人被困在宇宙飞船里那么久\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}When you're stuck in a spaceship for that long,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:18:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,吃的就至关重要了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}food is everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 米奇1号\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Warning, Mickey 1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,超出目前的口粮份额7卡路里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Seven calories over the current ration allocation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,在自助餐厅吃饭的第一天\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}On that first day in the cafeteria,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不住开始想\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I think I might have started thinking,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"我造了什么孽" 真的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"What have I done?" a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,整个餐厅的人都吃得生无可恋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The whole room was full of people eating this crappy food,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,餐厅里寂静得可怕 连针掉地上都听得见\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and there's total silence, like, you could hear a pin drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.17,0:18:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,直到肯尼斯·马歇尔和他的妻子伊尔法走了进来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Until, Kenneth Marshall and his wife, Ylfa, walk in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 许多人都开始为之疯狂\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And a whole bunch of people just started going nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我想着 "我到底在这里干什么呢"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I was thinking, "What the hell am I doing here?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这时我看到了她\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But that's when I saw her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我第一次见到纳莎·巴瑞吉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That was the first time I saw Nasha Barridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是旅途的第一天\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}On day one in this long journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,演说 演说 演说…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Speech! Speech! Speech! Speech!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 停吧 停吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All right, enough. Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,鼓掌欢呼一分钟会浪费掉5卡路里热量\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Keep that up for one minute and you waste five calories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是你们宝贵餐食热量的百分之二\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's two percent of the precious meal you're eating right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大家知道 我们在正式到达\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}As you know, our number one priority{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,尼福尔海姆星球之前的第一要务 就是节约粮食资源\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}is to conserve food resources until our arrival at Niflheim,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才能尽可能地提高存活率\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}so that we maximize our survival rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以听我说\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我以性生活举例\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sexual intercourse, for example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 每做... - 一次\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Each... - Session.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一次 就要消耗足足一百卡路里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...session consumes a whopping 100 calories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 至少一百 - 至少一百\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- At least. - At least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,具体取决于 参与者、时长、摩擦次数等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Depending on the participants, duration times friction equals...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:20:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,总而言之 肯尼斯正在和委员会讨论\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The point is, Kenneth is talking to the Committee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在飞船上全面禁止性生活\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}about banning all sexual activity on the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我没什么意见\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, I don't have a problem with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.41,0:21:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你确定现在提这事合适吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Darling, are you sure this is the right time to bring that up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 亲爱的 不好意思 我只是想帮你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Honey, I'm sorry. I was just trying to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 没关系\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的表现还行吗 我要强硬点吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Am I doing okay? Should I go harder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 是的 强硬点  - 好的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Yes! Yes, go hard. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拓荒者同胞们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Fellow pioneers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们到达了尼福尔海姆 并保证了粮食生产\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}once we've arrived in Niflheim and we've secured our food production,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将立即发起有史以来 最伟大的性事鼓励运动 我保证\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}we will launch the greatest sex encouragement campaign in history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 将在整个星球播撒你们的种子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You will spread your seed across the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.33,0:21:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,先保生计 再求发达\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}First we survive! Then we thrive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,随后寻求繁殖后代\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Then we go forth and multiply!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要传播物种\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Propagate the species!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在那片土地上繁衍\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We shall infest the land!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.75,0:22:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,马歇尔 马歇尔 马歇尔\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Marshall! Marshall! Marshall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我们开始了繁衍\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And so we started infesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.72,0:22:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有爱的那种\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}With love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:13.48,提示,,0,0,0,,(关键星球位置)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:16.10,提示,,0,0,0,,这里 还有 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.35,0:22:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,接着 很不幸 这里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And then, unfortunately, this is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.02,0:22:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,该画这里了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah. And now do this bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.41,0:22:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是有纳莎 那4年会感觉像40年那么久\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Those four years would have felt like 40 if it weren't for Nasha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.35,0:22:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,最开心的时候是她陪着我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}She stayed with me in the best of times...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.76,0:22:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,最痛苦的时候身边也是她\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...and kept by my side in the worst of times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.97,0:22:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不是每个人都有幸能找到这样的灵魂伴侣\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Not everyone gets lucky enough to find a soulmate like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.10,0:23:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没上这艘飞船 这一切都不会发生\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}None of this would have happened if I'd never boarded this spaceship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.44,0:23:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,放高利贷的达赖厄斯·布朗克万岁\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}so all hail the great loan shark, Darius Blank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.57,0:23:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 达赖厄斯\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Thanks, Darius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可我也没偷懒\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But it wasn't like I was slacking, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我天天都超级忙碌 忙着照顾纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I was super busy every day, taking care of Nasha,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.53,0:23:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,她可是个全能的精英特工\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and she's an all-in-one elite agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好她可不容易\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And it's not easy supporting someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.33,0:23:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为她不仅是个军人 警察 还是个消防员\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}who's a soldier, a police officer, and a firefighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.10,0:23:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可是她看上我什么了 我也搞不清楚\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But what she sees in me, I got no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.46,0:23:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我满心感激\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm just grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.22,0:23:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可一旦我踏出房门\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But as soon as I step out the door,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,飞船上到处都是 无聊的白痴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}the ship was filled with mostly... dickheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.97,0:23:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey! Mickey, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.01,0:23:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,方便问一下吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Can we just ask...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.27,0:23:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,死是什么感觉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well... what's it like to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.98,0:23:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 在你被重新打印时 那是什么感觉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You know, when you're reprinted? Yeah, how does that feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.32,0:23:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 告诉我们吧 我们是真想知道\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on, just tell us. We really want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.82,0:23:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,想象一下跟这种蠢货挤在一起好几年\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Imagine spending years, elbow-to-elbow with these bozos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会说\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He won't tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.70,0:23:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这种感受足以让任何人抓狂\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It was enough to push anyone over the edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.00,0:23:59.20,旁白二,,0,0,0,,- "你得先杀了我!" - "杀了我的尸体!"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- "You'd have to kill me first!" - "Over my dead body!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有时候 甚至纳莎这种模范市民 - 杀了你们的尸体?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}-Sometimes even Nasha who is a model citizen... -Over your dead body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.40,0:24:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也不得不站出来提醒他们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...would have to step in and remind us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杀了你们的尸体? - 我们是快乐的一家人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}-Over your dead body? -that we were all one big happy family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.51,0:24:09.70,旁白二,,0,0,0,,- 你们想干什么 - 我们该互相帮助\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}-Where do you think you're going -There to help one another{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该互相支持\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There to have each other's backs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.72,0:24:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 应该是一个紧密团结的和谐社区 - 你说什么?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}-A tight-knit harmonious community. -What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,委员会决定将米奇9号的口粮减半\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And the Committee has reduced Mickey 9's rations by half{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.06,0:24:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,并指派其去手动清洁循环站\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and assigned him to manual cycler cleaning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.52,0:24:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,直至另行通知\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}until further notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.77,0:24:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Congrats, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.05,0:24:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.19,0:24:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定饿了 多吃一点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You must be hungry. Have some more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.15,0:24:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 卡伊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, thanks, Kai. Um--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.82,0:24:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你换洗发水了?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do you change your shampoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.45,0:24:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,洗发水?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Shampoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.74,0:24:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,整艘飞船上就一款洗发水\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There's only one shampoo in this entire spaceship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.91,0:24:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 没事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Thank you. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.67,0:24:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,旅途极为漫长 但是大家关系都非常好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It was a very long trip in a beautiful community.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.38,0:24:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 纳莎 她显然是我的 我的唯一\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But, uh, Nasha was obviously my one and only, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:24:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}For real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.39,0:25:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,说到我独一无二的工作 我感到非常自豪\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And as for my one and only job, I was proud of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.10,0:25:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它让我感觉是团队的一份子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Felt like I was part of the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,马修 马修\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Matthew! Matthew!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.53,0:25:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我打到最后一关了 - 快去 赶紧的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- I'm on the last level! - Come on, hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.91,0:25:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我同行的兄弟们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}My brother travelers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.58,0:25:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,以及姐妹们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- And sisters. - And sisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.87,0:25:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走了这么远的路程\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It is long that we have come,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.88,0:25:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在飞船上共度了四年\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}four years together in this ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.34,0:25:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,而我 我们 像爱家人一样爱着每一个人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And I, we, love you like our very own family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.59,0:25:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于到了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And here we are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.55,0:25:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在下面静静等待的 是属于我们的 纯净的星球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}right below us awaits our very own planet of purity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.39,0:25:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙有什么毛病 烦死人了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What the fuck is wrong with him? He's so annoying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.48,0:25:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是得了流感什么的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Maybe he has the flu or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.11,0:25:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,宛如刚做好的香草冰激凌\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Like a virgin vanilla ice cream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.45,0:25:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,即将第一次受到触摸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Touched for the very first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,上面肯定非常冷\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's gonna be really cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.37,0:26:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,头一个下去的人肯定会冻死的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Whoever's going down there first is gonna freeze to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.91,0:26:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好 米奇 深呼吸 把肺吸饱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's it, Mickey. Deep breaths. Fill your lungs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.50,0:26:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,想象空气中有一种未知病毒\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Imagine there's an unknown virus in the air{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.09,0:26:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,而你要把周围漂浮的每一个粒子都吸进去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and you're sucking in every single microscopic particle floating around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,让所有的病毒 充斥你的每一个肺泡\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All the viruses fill every alveoli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.93,0:26:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,非常棒\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.64,0:26:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 完美\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So good! Brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.77,0:26:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,空气中确实有一种未知病毒\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There really was an unknown virus in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.40,0:26:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,非常致命\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A lethal one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.22,0:26:49.00,提示,,0,0,0,,(尼福尔海姆  病毒样本检测)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.66,0:27:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,多萝西 多萝西\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Dorothy! Dorothy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.59,0:27:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 他还活着\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, wait. He's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.76,0:27:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎么样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So fucking what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.22,0:27:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.47,0:27:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.39,0:27:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,到了最后 通过小白鼠米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}In the end, thanks to the lab rats,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.85,0:27:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,12号 13号 14号 15号和16号的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey 12, 13, 14, 15 and 16,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.77,0:27:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,被刺 吸毒气 被抛弃和被烧掉 我们取得了疫苗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}getting stabbed, gassed, dumped and burned, we got the vaccine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.90,0:27:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我馈赠人类的大礼\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}My great gift to mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.90,0:28:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我们不用戴氧气面罩\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And so, we didn't need oxygen masks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.66,0:28:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以直接尽情地呼吸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and we could see our breath as much as we wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.54,0:28:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看 詹妮弗 太荒谬了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look at that, Jennifer. Ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.60,0:28:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们居然还住在里面\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I can't believe we still live in that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.58,0:28:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,确实荒谬\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.83,0:28:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,都已经登陆这么久了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Landfall was ages ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.31,0:28:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们却还在吃那些垃圾飞行即食餐\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and we're still eating the same crappy in-flight TV dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.13,0:28:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这也就是我们应该在这里建造住宅区的原因\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Precisely why we ought to build residential complexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.84,0:28:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,以便尽快种植作物\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You know, grow crops as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.72,0:28:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 没错 - 我们要播撒种子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Yeah, sure. - You know, spread the seed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.47,0:28:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里繁衍 传播我们这个物种\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}infest the land, propagate the species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.39,0:28:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,冻死人了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's freezing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.21,0:28:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你看那颜色\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Whoa. Look at that color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.29,0:28:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 好美…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Yeah. - It's beautiful--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.50,0:29:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真是笨手笨脚的 你应该学一些护身倒法\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's such a klutz. You should learn some breakfall moves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.59,0:29:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事吧 - 我没事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- You okay? - Yeah, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.47,0:29:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.14,0:29:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是护身倒法\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's breakfall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.56,0:29:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你看卡伊 她的护身倒法是教科书级别的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look at Kai. Textbook perfect breakfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.19,0:29:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗  - 闭嘴吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Yeah? - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.65,0:29:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,卡伊 怎么了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Kai. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.87,0:29:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 那是什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, God! What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.08,0:29:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快甩掉 快甩掉 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Get it off! Get it off! Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.63,0:29:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼 怎么搞的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What the fuck, man? What the fuck? What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.88,0:29:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西 什么东西 那是什么东西\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What was that? What the heck was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.93,0:29:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 但是洞里还有\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't know, but there are more in the hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.80,0:29:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我们快离开这里吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- What-- - Let's get the fuck out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.76,0:29:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快 米奇 快走\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on, Mickey, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.85,0:29:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 走 快 快\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Go, go, go. Move! Move!{\r}
