Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.70,0:33:00.21,提示,,0,0,0,,(米奇18号)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.42,0:33:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪里 这是怎么回事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Where am I? What's going on?{\r}
