Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.74,0:38:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你是18号? 是今天打印出来的?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're 18? They printed you out today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.21,0:38:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事啊 按提莫的说法\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What the fuck is going on? According to Timo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.13,0:38:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该正在离开某只恐怖虫的后门\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}you should be sliding out of one of those creeper's assholes right about now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.38,0:38:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你非得这么说话吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do you have to put it like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.38,0:38:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我彻底完了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, God. I'm completely fucked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.76,0:38:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.50,0:38:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是多重身\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We're Multiples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.70,0:39:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I gotta kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.86,0:39:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,杀我?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.53,0:39:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们两个得死一个 大概也得是你自杀\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I mean, you should probably kill yourself if one of us has to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.50,0:39:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我才被打印出来两个小时\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's been, like, two hours since I was printed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.46,0:39:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人生才开始\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I've barely had a life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.92,0:39:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来就没死 所以你不算数\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, I was never dead, so you don't count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.84,0:39:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,回循环站去吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Go back to the cycler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.43,0:39:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,多重身 该从哪里说起呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Multiples. Where do I even begin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.43,0:39:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,人类还无法应对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mankind is not equipped to deal with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.52,0:39:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,人体打印技术投入使用后\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}the legal and ethical implications{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.50,0:39:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所导致的法律与伦理层面的后果\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}of adopting this human printing technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.30,0:39:43.10,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\pos(78,235)\an1\b0}四又三分之二年前  地球
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.55,0:39:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,请你们告诉我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Please tell me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.12,0:39:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们谁能够保证\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}can any of you honestly guarantee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.32,0:39:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这项技术今后不会被人滥用?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that the technology will not be abused?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.57,0:39:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,研发部里没有人能给出让人信服的答案\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No one in their R and D department could come up with a convincing answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.60,0:39:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但真正的问题在于\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But the real problem was that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.10,0:39:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,人体打印背后的一位智囊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}one of the brains behind human printing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.50,0:40:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好是个不折不扣的变态\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}turned out to be a certified psychopath,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.55,0:40:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫阿兰·玛尼科瓦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Alan Manikova.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.75,0:40:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得是他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I think it's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.70,0:40:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.92,0:40:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有人对无家可归者\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There was this series of particularly brutal murders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.80,0:40:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,犯下了一系列极其凶残的命案 目击者只有一个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}targeting homeless people, and only one eyewitness account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.10,0:40:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但她的描述完全符合玛尼科瓦的长相\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But it matched Alan Manikova's appearance to a tee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.98,0:40:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,警察以为自己找对了人 只不过玛尼科瓦有着充分的不在场证明\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The cops thought they had their man, except Manikova had a sure-fire alibi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,命案发生时\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}At the time of the murder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.73,0:40:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在化妆 准备上一档少儿科学节目\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}he was getting his make-up done for a children's science show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能帮忙找个人过来帮我带一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...come and help me with the red blood cells{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.86,0:40:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,演红细胞和白细胞的小朋友啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and the white blood cells, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.53,0:40:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但警察摸透了他的底细\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But the cops had his number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.20,0:40:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在搜查他的住处时\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}When they raided Manikova's house,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.03,0:40:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,带了双份手铐和逮捕令\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}they brought two sets of handcuffs and warrants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.91,0:40:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,警察就要逮到他了 或者说 要逮到他们了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They were on to him. Or rather, they were on to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.17,0:40:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是玛尼科瓦原身?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Which one's Manikova Prime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.42,0:40:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是你?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.80,0:40:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Or you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.20,0:40:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 有两个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yep, there were two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.01,0:40:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一个杀人 一个提供不在场证明\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One for the murder and one for the alibi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.73,0:40:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,玛尼科瓦瞒着公司\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Manikova had printed another Manikova{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.30,0:40:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,打印出了另一个玛尼科瓦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}without the company knowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.90,0:41:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,问你们一个问题啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And so here's a question for you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.00,0:41:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他们究竟是共犯 还是一个听命于另一个呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}are they accomplices or did one act under the other's orders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.86,0:41:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这些命案是两个人分开犯下的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are these separate, independent crimes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.57,0:41:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还是打一开始就是同一个人犯下的?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}or were they one person from the get-go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.03,0:41:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们坐牢是只能各吃半份牢饭\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They only get half portions in jail,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.99,0:41:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还是各吃一份\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}or do they get a full meal each?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.36,0:41:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,警方 法律专家和哲学家\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Police, legal experts, philosophers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.20,0:41:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,个个想破了脑袋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}everyone was stumped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.47,0:41:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可是就在玛尼科瓦1号和2号\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But while Manikova 1 and 2 were both{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.00,0:41:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,双双被关在审讯室里的时候\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}locked up in an interrogation room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.87,0:41:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,又有一个无家可归的男人 被残忍杀害了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}another homeless man was brutally murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.00,0:41:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊 是玛尼科瓦3号\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Lo and behold, Manikova 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.52,0:41:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想 "多重身"这个词\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I think it was some cheap tabloid reporter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.60,0:41:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是某个小报记者 或者教授之类的人发明的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}who called them Multiples, or some professor or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.60,0:41:48.15,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,250)}(阿兰·玛尼科瓦1号  阿兰·玛尼科瓦2号  阿兰·玛尼科瓦3号)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.10,0:41:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,反正就这么沿用下来了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Whoever came up with it, it stuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.11,0:41:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很快 人们对多重身嗤之以鼻 但又心生恐惧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And pretty soon the word "Multiples" spread fear and contempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.58,0:41:54.45,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,250)}(多重身引发人类空前的震惊与恐惧)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.45,0:41:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,多重身令人厌恶 他们破坏了自然规律\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So Multiples are an abomination. They destroy the natural order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.90,0:42:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,每个灵魂只能拥有一个身体 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Each soul shall only have one body. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.75,0:42:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一个灵魂 对应一个身体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One soul, one body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.16,0:42:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,主呢 只保佑这种一对一的结合\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The Lord, he only blesses this one-to-one union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.00,0:42:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 前国会议员马歇尔提出的一点引人深思\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But former congressman Marshall does have a point worth considering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.55,0:42:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不对这项先进技术加以探索应用 实在是太可惜了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It would be a shame not to explore the potential application of this advanced technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.30,0:42:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,收到委员会的邀请 我本人很开心\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I was happy to receive an invitation from this committee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.14,0:42:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们传唤的您 马歇尔先生\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You were subpoenaed, Mr. Marshall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.27,0:42:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是 是 不管怎样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sure, sure. In any case,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.30,0:42:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我想借此机会 以远征指挥官的身份讲两句\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I want to take this opportunity to speak as an Expedition Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.60,0:42:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,人体打印是一种罪过\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Human printing is a sin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.10,0:42:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,多重身则是撒旦之作\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Multiples are Satan's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.45,0:42:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 我一直在思考\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}However, I've been contemplating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.75,0:42:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如何利用这种可憎之物 为我们共同的经济利益服务\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}how can we use this abomination for our common economic benefit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.21,0:42:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我提议...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I propose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.09,0:42:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在远离地球的地方 在最严格的监管下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}a trial run of human printing far from Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.59,0:42:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,进行一次人体打印试验\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}under the strictest oversight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.59,0:43:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,每支远征队 每个星球只能派出一个人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Limiting such individuals to one per expedition, per planet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.39,0:43:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们称这群人为 "消耗体"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}under the designation, "Expendable."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.00,0:43:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,至于多重身 在这一方面\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Multiples, in the case of Multiples,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.15,0:43:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,任何触法作恶的个体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}we exterminate every offending individual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.20,0:43:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,都应一律消灭 身心俱除 这样做完全是出于对公共利益的考量\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}in totality, mind and body, all for the sake of public service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.74,0:43:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在这次尼福尔海姆远征中\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}On this Niflheim expedition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.66,0:43:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所有多重身将即刻被逮捕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}all Multiples will immediately be arrested,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.59,0:43:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,处决 并且永久删除\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}executed, and permanently deleted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.42,0:43:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,头好痛啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}My head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.26,0:43:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这个家伙到底是怎么回事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What the hell is this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.26,0:43:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎告诉我 米奇3号既爱抱怨又黏人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha told me that Mickey 3 was whiny and clingy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.18,0:43:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,5号优柔寡断\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}5 was, uh, indecisive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.31,0:43:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,8号挺让人讨厌的 还有点笨\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And apparently, 8 was pretty annoying and kinda stupid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.98,0:43:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们几个都算正常\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but none of them were complete nutjobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.90,0:43:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就连这个疯子也害怕成为多重身\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Even this lunatic is scared of being a Multiple though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.90,0:44:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不然就会被永久删除\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's permanent deletion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.27,0:44:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他想把我扔进循环站\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Trying to trash me in the cycler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.29,0:44:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们其中一个必须死...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}If one of us has to go...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.00,0:44:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人不会是我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...it ain't gonna be me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.57,0:44:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对半分 对半\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Half it! Half it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.28,0:44:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对半分 对半 对半分\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Half, half, half!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.74,0:44:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 对半 对半分\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- What? - Half it. Half!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.04,0:44:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你对半分\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'll half it with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.45,0:44:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,口粮分你一半 工作量也能平分\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'll half the rations. We could split the workload, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.08,0:44:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还可以轮流去死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And we can take turns dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.10,0:44:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你是18号嘛 偶数 偶数的都归你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And you're 18, so you can take all even numbers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.26,0:45:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,轮到19号 21号 这种奇数的时候我来负责\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and I-I'll just cover, like, 19, 21, and the odd numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.80,0:45:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕死亡吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are you afraid to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.97,0:45:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话有点怕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Kinda, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.39,0:45:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经死过很多次了 还怕什么呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You died plenty of times. What are you so scared of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.48,0:45:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在这之前 我死了之后...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Until now, I died and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.94,0:45:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就会直接重生 你看\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I was just born again, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.50,0:45:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉就像我在不断地 延续下去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It felt like it was mecontinuing on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.40,0:45:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可是现在...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.82,0:45:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦我死了...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}once I die...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.45,0:45:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说就彻底完了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}it'll be over for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.83,0:45:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,活下去的只有你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It'll be youliving on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.88,0:45:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You get what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.89,0:45:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.39,0:45:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个混蛋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're such a little bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.72,0:45:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我就是你啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But I'm you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.20,0:45:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.48,0:45:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会像你一样活着\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm not gonna live like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.40,0:45:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm gonna kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.71,0:46:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是在干什么 生怕别人注意不到你吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What the fuck, man? Are you trying to get noticed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.64,0:46:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这里都没有摄像头 把那玩意儿摘下来吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They don't even have cameras. Take that off, dumbass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,菜鸟 你是第一次来吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Amateur. Your first time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.52,0:46:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.93,0:46:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这货很纯吧 没稀释过吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is the pure stuff, right? Undiluted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.90,0:46:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我当成什么人了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Who do you think you're talking to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.44,0:46:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 可是没掺水的纯奥施多福\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is pure, uncut Oxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.95,0:46:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,紧俏货\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's fucking rare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.16,0:46:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一把爆燃枪只能换两颗 伙计\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You only get two Oxyzofol capsules in one flamethrower, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.62,0:46:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.62,0:46:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我有感觉了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.12,0:46:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 怎么就有感觉了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.50,0:47:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这么用的 得先打开\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's not a thing. Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.17,0:47:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要不要直接杀了那个混蛋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Should we just kill that son of a bitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.88,0:47:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就是跟你开个玩笑 - 什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- I was just joking around. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.38,0:47:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别装傻了好吧 你的记忆就是我的记忆\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Don't act surprised. Your memories are my memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.18,0:47:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋挥霍无度\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The money he blew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.10,0:47:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把大部分贷款都记在我们名下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That bastard put most of the loans under our name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.60,0:47:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,挂在达赖厄斯·布朗克的账上 最后我们还得负责\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}In Darius Blank's ledger, we're the ones on the hook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.40,0:47:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事还没坐实呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That needs fact checking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.90,0:47:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好好享用吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Have fun, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.30,0:47:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,走 杀了他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Let's kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.65,0:47:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 我就他这么一个朋友\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are you crazy? He-He's, like, my only friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.28,0:47:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友 不就是在一个孤儿院待过吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Friend? Same orphanage doesn't mean shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.24,0:47:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.01,0:47:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Timo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.33,0:47:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 你怎么...?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, what...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.21,0:47:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你的生意越做越大啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Looks like business is blowing up, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.00,0:47:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是什么意思\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What're you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.55,0:47:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了一个瘾君子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Another junky coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.73,0:48:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Timo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.61,0:48:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你有病吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey! Are you mental?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.77,0:48:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把手给我 - 等我上去 看我不宰了你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait until I get out of here. I'm gonna kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.49,0:48:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The fuck is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.36,0:48:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,再往下一点 你个白痴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come down lower! You fucking idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.46,0:48:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.38,0:48:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 快来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.09,0:48:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 帮帮我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.18,0:48:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么 红彤彤的 看着很烫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What is that? Why is it so red? That looks hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.81,0:48:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.00,0:48:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你尝尝死的滋味\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I want you to have a go at dying,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.44,0:48:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,混账东西\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.90,0:48:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.30,0:48:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.41,0:48:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 快停下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Stop. Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.70,0:49:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.84,0:49:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那是米奇吗 发生什么事了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Is that Mickey? Hey, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.55,0:49:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 你怎么在这里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, what are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.64,0:49:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,提莫不小心掉了下去 不过 他现在没事了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, Timo accidentally fell in, but, uh, he's all right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.20,0:49:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要是想继续干那个勾当\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You wanna keep dealing, motherfucker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.23,0:49:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就把嘴闭紧点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Watch what you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.05,0:49:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你没事吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What happened? You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.11,0:49:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手怎么了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's up with your hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.62,0:49:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是想倒个垃圾 不小心掉进去了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just taking out the trash, and I tripped into the hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.70,0:49:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是有米奇 我可能早就化成灰了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I would've been a goner if not for Mickey. I almost became cycler dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.77,0:49:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.29,0:49:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.90,0:49:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了让你先躺一会儿 你才刚打印出来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Told you to stay in bed. It's only been a few hours since you were printed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.00,0:49:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我真该听你的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, I should've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.50,0:49:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,听说了吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You heard the rumors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.97,0:49:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,最近有人在偷偷地卖纯奥施多福\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Some guy out there is dealing undiluted Oxyzofol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.09,0:49:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 这人疯了吧 太离谱了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What? That's crazy. That's pretty messed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.26,0:50:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别往外说 提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Between us, Timo,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.00,0:50:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,睡前用一点缓解焦虑是可以理解的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}a drop here and there before bed to take the edge off, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.30,0:50:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是卖没掺水的纯货就过分了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But the pure, uncut stuff is crossing the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.73,0:50:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 太过分了 太糟糕了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, yeah, absolutely. That's bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.10,0:50:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 带米奇回去吧 我收尾就行\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, take Mickey home. I'll wrap up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.90,0:50:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢 明天见\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes. Thank you. I'll see you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.00,0:50:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 我想玩B6\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, today I feel like B6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.20,0:50:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- B6?  - 对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- B6? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.18,0:50:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎飞高高?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Flying Nasha?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.81,0:50:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里玩那招最合适了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's definitely the right place for that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.93,0:50:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's going on with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.10,0:50:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时可不这样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This isn't like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.73,0:50:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,B6?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}B6?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.07,0:50:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,B6是我们的啊 纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}B6 was ours, Nasha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.70,0:51:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.62,0:51:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,老弟\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.81,0:51:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要去找你呢 没想到你在这里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I was just headed to your room to get you, but here you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.92,0:51:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,状态不错 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Looking good, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.38,0:51:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 好了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, sir. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.63,0:51:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你站在这里 请你抱住他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You stand there. Arm around, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.55,0:51:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好 笑得开心点 米奇 可以吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Great. Good. Uh, big smile, Mickey, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.76,0:51:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拿着这个 - 开心一点 很好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Hold that. - Yeah, big smile. Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.09,0:51:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 请你们靠边站 好极了 谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sorry. Could you just stand-- Great, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.85,0:51:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 准备 开始\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, and action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.39,0:51:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.47,0:51:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,本月的幸运嘉宾已经揭晓\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This month's lucky winner, the fortunate soul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.50,0:51:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他将受邀参加私人晚宴 看镜头\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}who'll have the privilege of a private dinner--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.44,0:51:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,与独具魅力的肯尼斯·马歇尔共进晚餐 他就是…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}At the camera-- who'll have a private dinner with the one and only Kenneth Marshall is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.11,0:51:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看镜头\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Down the barrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.57,0:51:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.95,0:51:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 笑一笑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Great. Big smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.57,0:51:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,笑一笑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.66,0:51:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 太棒了 很好 停\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There. Amazing. Okay, cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.83,0:51:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 马歇尔叫你赶紧过去 好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now, Marshall wants you to come ASAP, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.04,0:51:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他特地为你准备了大餐\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's got a whole feast prepared just for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.33,0:51:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,主真是格外眷顾你啊 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The Lord is truly blessing you today, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.00,0:51:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着 我得先回我房间\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}First, I need to go back to my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.42,0:51:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你就要大吃一顿了 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You get to stuff your fucking face, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.60,0:52:01.05,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,250)}(本月唯一的嘉宾 与肯尼斯·马歇尔的特别晚餐)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.80,0:51:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜那个变态现在肯定已经\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I bet that freak is probably drooling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.84,0:52:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对着我美丽的纳莎直流口水了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}all over my beautiful Nasha already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.05,0:52:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太恶心了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.47,0:52:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,更恶心的是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's even more disgusting is that I'm drooling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.39,0:52:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一想到一会儿就能吃上菲力牛排\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}at the thought of the tenderloin steak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.10,0:52:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我就忍不住直流口水\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I ordered for Marshall's dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.81,0:52:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这太不对劲了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is so wrong!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.70,0:52:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃得这么开心 真是太好了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So glad you seem to be enjoying it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.62,0:52:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,酱汁还可口吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How's the sauce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.20,0:52:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.91,0:52:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 你先吃 请继续\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, sorry, sorry. Please, continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.50,0:52:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, yeah, Mickey. Uh--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.05,0:52:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 回头说起那个谁的事 那个…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Listen, going back to everything that happened with, uh--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.77,0:52:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.88,0:52:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 詹妮弗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.60,0:52:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,詹妮弗...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Jennifer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.96,0:52:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,姓奇尔顿\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Chilton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.09,0:52:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I know, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.26,0:52:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们痛失亲爱的詹妮弗·奇尔顿时\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}When we lost our dear Jennifer Chilton,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.51,0:52:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能有点不太高兴 还说了一些难听的话\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I may have gotten a little angry and said some terribly unkind things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.06,0:52:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 现在说这些晚了 但我还是想道个歉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I know it's late, and I want to apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.52,0:52:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他总是这样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's always like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.73,0:52:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,平时很讨人喜欢 有时会突然心狠手辣\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Such an adorable man and then suddenly he's all cutthroat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.70,0:53:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我想把这件事做成 好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Darling, I'm trying to make it here. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.87,0:53:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你刚打印出来 还软乎乎的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sorry. You're still squishy, fresh out of the printer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.40,0:53:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你先多吃点吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Continue feeding yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.04,0:53:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,反正 我们还有一位特邀嘉宾呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh. Anyway, we have another special guest here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.33,0:53:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,卡伊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hi, Kai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.96,0:53:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我来晚了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sorry, I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.50,0:53:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你今天真好看 - 谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- You look very nice. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.76,0:53:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.84,0:53:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 坐吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- It's good to see you. - Sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.09,0:53:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你的情绪还好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You okay? Emotionally?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.85,0:53:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 长官 谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, I feel fine, sir. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.18,0:53:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没事就好 卡伊 我很遗憾詹妮弗出了这种事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm glad to hear it, Kai. I'm so sorry about Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.85,0:53:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你们关系很好 她是你最好的朋友\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I hear you were extremely close. Your best friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.48,0:53:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但我相信 你会坚强地挺过去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But I knew you'd stay strong throughout it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.66,0:53:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 夫人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Thank you, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.40,0:53:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们请你来 不仅仅是为了安慰你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But we didn't invite you here simply to comfort you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.41,0:53:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你得到了我们的青睐 卡茨\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We've had our eyes on you, Katz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.95,0:53:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 嗯\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- On me, sir? - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.79,0:53:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,能告诉我原因吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}May I ask why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.80,0:53:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是同类人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.77,0:53:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你的基因完美无缺\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}With your impeccable genetics,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.60,0:54:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是我理想中的殖民地完美样本\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}you are the perfect specimen for the colony I envision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.76,0:54:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.30,0:54:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 教会 我是说公司\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's why the church, I mean, um, company,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.93,0:54:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,才会选我来领导这次远征\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}has chosen me to lead this expedition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.18,0:54:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,地球已经没救了 混血儿太多\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The Earth's beyond saving with all its muddy people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.02,0:54:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可你不一样 你很特别\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But you, you're something special,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.48,0:54:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的世界\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and I'm creating a world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.05,0:54:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,必须建立在充满上等人种的纯白星球上\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}on a pure white planet full of superior people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.03,0:54:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,像你一样 也像我们一样 对吧 亲爱的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Like you. And us. Isn't that right, darling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.95,0:54:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 这是他的愿景 - 我的愿景\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Yes. Mmm. It's his vision. - My vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.87,0:54:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也是他的情怀 - 我的情怀\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- His sensibilities. - Sensibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.58,0:54:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不过说实话 有体检数据在手\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But let's be honest, with your medical records in hand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.62,0:54:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你还宁愿跑来加入我们的远征\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}you ran to join our expedition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.00,0:54:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也不去其他那些可悲的星球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}instead of one of those pathetic planets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.15,0:54:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那些地方竟然把微芯片\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}where they plant microchips{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.21,0:54:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,植入人工受孕的胚胎当中\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}in their artificially inseminated baby embryos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.76,0:54:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的是尼福尔海姆\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You really are the perfect candidate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.43,0:54:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,自然分娩计划的完美候选人 亲爱的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}for Niflheim's natural child birthing program, aren't you, dear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.45,0:54:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,马歇尔先生 在你眼里我只是个子宫吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mr. Marshall, am I just a uterus to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.10,0:55:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不不不 不是那样的 卡伊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No! No, no, no. It's nothing like that, Kai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.57,0:55:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 这个男人才不会物化女性呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, this man is not one to objectify women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.40,0:55:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我丈夫的意思是 他选人的标准非常高\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All my husband means to say is he has very high standards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.41,0:55:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他唯一的梦想 就是建立一个只属于纯种人类的星球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}His only dream is of a planet exclusively for a pure human race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.91,0:55:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这将消耗大量自然生长的农作物 肉类\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That consumes real crops, and real meat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.79,0:55:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,以及有精致美味酱汁的晚餐\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and dinners with delicate, delicious sauces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.42,0:55:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,酱汁才是文明的真正试金石\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, sauce is the true litmus test of civilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.17,0:55:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那些吞食焦肉的都是野蛮人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}People who devour burnt meat are barbarians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.68,0:55:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快尝尝这酱汁 卡伊 来 我亲手做的哦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do try the sauce, Kai. Here, I made it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.60,0:55:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.77,0:55:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我想先说几句话 怀念一下詹妮弗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But first, I'd like to say a few words in Jennifer's memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.69,0:55:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,几句祷告词\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A prayer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.65,0:55:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,祷告随时可以开始\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Always ready for a prayer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.90,0:55:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,詹妮弗 四年前我在餐厅遇见你时\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Jennifer, when I first met you at the cafeteria four years ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.95,0:55:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You were...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.55,0:56:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的主...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Dear Lord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.70,0:56:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,詹妮弗·奇尔顿那独一无二的灵魂\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Jennifer Chilton's one and only soul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.72,0:56:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,离开了卡伊 她那位了不起的朋友\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}was taken from her wonderful friend, Kai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.09,0:56:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的主...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Dear Lord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.60,0:56:20.60,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 我们独一无二的主 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.60,0:56:29.60,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 全能的主让我们颂唱我父的恩典 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.40,0:56:34.80,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 感谢上帝 万能的主 我们终获自由 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.80,0:56:38.00,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 我们要去应许之地 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.00,0:56:41.80,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 圣光笼罩中的白色海洋 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.80,0:56:45.30,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 你的王国在我们眼前 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.30,0:56:48.76,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 哈利路亚 哈利路亚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.76,0:56:50.95,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 我们以天选之心侍奉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.19,0:56:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,医疗部\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Medical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.15,0:56:57.02,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 就在此地此时 从永远到永恒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.02,0:56:59.00,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 阿门 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.02,0:57:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 长官 这真是太尴尬了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Apologies, sir. This is embarrassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.73,0:57:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚才吃的细胞培养肉里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The cultured meat that he just ate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.36,0:57:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,含有一种实验性生长激素\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}includes an experimental growth hormone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.70,0:57:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很显然这仍然存在风险 真的非常抱歉 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Obviously, it's still risky. I'm so very sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.33,0:57:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定不是因为他吃得太多了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're sure it's not because he was eating so much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.29,0:57:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚才胡吃海塞的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He was stuffing his friggin' pie hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.96,0:57:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是的 长官 您看 他的脖子上起了红疹\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, not quite, sir. You see the red rash on his neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.62,0:57:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是生长激素的副作用\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's a side effect of the growth hormone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.84,0:57:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我太惭愧了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm so ashamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.84,0:57:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我会承担全部责任 并立即辞去我的职务\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I take full responsibility and resign my position immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.22,0:57:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 不是你的错 人造肉就是个垃圾\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, no, no, not at all. I mean, artificial meat is crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.01,0:57:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不从失败中汲取教训\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How are we supposed to improve it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.51,0:57:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么能成功呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}unless we fail upward to perfection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.15,0:57:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 阿卡迪...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No. Arkady...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.98,0:57:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到挫折也要抬头挺胸 就像我一样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...stand tall in your failures like me, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.36,0:57:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官 谢谢您\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, sir. Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.48,0:57:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,指挥官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.48,0:57:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你是用他来测试飞行即食餐的吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So you are testing out your in-flight TV dinner on him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.30,0:57:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,飞行即食餐?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}In-flight TV dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.16,0:57:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在那帮年轻人都是这么叫它的吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Is that what the young troops are calling it now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.92,0:57:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不  - 借过一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- No. - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.00,0:58:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在很难受吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are you in a lot of pain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.67,0:58:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的惩罚\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm being punished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.00,0:58:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 这是给我的惩罚\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- What? - It's my punishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.88,0:58:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我该去找纳莎的 不该来这里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I should've gone to Nasha and not come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.55,0:58:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,多萝西 给我紫色乔\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Dorothy, bring me Purple Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.02,0:58:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 您还记得我们一直在研发的特殊止痛药吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sir, you remember the special painkiller we've been developing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.98,0:58:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,记得 紫色乔\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, Purple Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.35,0:58:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,给特工们快速止疼用的 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's a quick fix for injured agents, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.40,0:58:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 鉴于米奇现在非常难受\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah. Since Mickey here is in such awful pain,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.36,0:58:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以利用这个机会进行测试 所以...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}it's a perfect opportunity to try a little test, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.90,0:58:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打上吧 - 好的 来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Give it to him. - Great, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.00,0:58:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 紫色乔\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on, Purple Joe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.79,0:58:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 等一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.42,0:58:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要碰他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Don't touch him, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.13,0:58:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 你能看到我吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, can you see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.51,0:58:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey? Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.85,0:59:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 快给我下来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Oh, sorry. - Get back down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.89,0:59:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey? Mickey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.68,0:59:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 天啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, God. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.40,0:59:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, my God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.24,0:59:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh. What do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.29,0:59:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 止痛药没有效果\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Apologies, sir. The painkiller's not working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.75,0:59:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.66,0:59:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别拍了 普雷斯顿 请把摄像机关掉吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Don't film this, Preston. Please, turn it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.46,0:59:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他更人性化 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is better, right? More humane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.22,0:59:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 长官 这样更人性化\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, sir. More humane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.30,0:59:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 你这是在干什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, no, no. What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.55,0:59:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想把我的地毯打个洞吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You can't tear a hole in my fucking carpet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.31,0:59:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那从侧面开枪就好了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, we'll just shoot him from the side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.31,0:59:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,血会流到上面的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But what about the blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.10,0:59:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是大不里士的波斯地毯\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is a Persian Tabriz!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.81,0:59:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 冷静点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Honey, calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.32,0:59:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Shoot now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.73,0:59:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.57,0:59:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是你邀请我们来吃晚餐的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This was supposed to be a fucking dinner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.03,0:59:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你的客人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's your guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.95,1:00:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,卡伊·卡茨特工 你又是怎么回事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Agent Kai Katz, what the hell's going on with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.83,1:00:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是个人肉矩阵 是个破打印体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's a meat matrix. He's a goddamn print job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.00,1:00:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,消耗体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}An Expendable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.80,1:00:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是他自愿的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He signed up for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.80,1:00:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.50,1:00:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是为了我们的星球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is for our planet, agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.09,1:00:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.55,1:00:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,指挥官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.59,1:00:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,请你不要开枪\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Please don't shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.90,1:00:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm okay now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.39,1:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕不是吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.40,1:00:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他看上去还是很痛苦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He still seems like he's in a lot of pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.65,1:00:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定很难受\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Of course he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.65,1:00:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的没事了吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are you really okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.66,1:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你请我吃晚餐\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just... thank you for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.12,1:00:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快到我的房间了 去洗漱吧 再休息一下 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}My room's just there. You need to clean up and rest, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.08,1:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 我能走路\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Don't worry about me. I can walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.35,1:00:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是得回我的房间 纳莎就要...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I just need to get back to my room. Nasha's about to--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.34,1:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 我们要去我那里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Actually, we're going to mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.32,1:01:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给你 已经干了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Here. It's dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.74,1:01:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,每次肚子疼时我就会煮这个茶\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I drink this whenever I have a stomach ache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.60,1:01:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,从地球上带来的 很珍贵 我一直都省着喝\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's from Earth. It's precious. So I've been saving it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.00,1:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这杯给你喝\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But I made some for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.80,1:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 坐吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Thanks. - Sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.56,1:01:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,坦白说 米奇 以前我不想问你这个问题\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You know, Mickey, I didn't want to ask you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.02,1:01:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但我就问这一次 好吗 实在对不住\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But just this once, okay? And I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.33,1:02:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡到底…是什么感觉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's it like... dying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.46,1:02:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你问这个是因为詹妮弗吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You asking because of Jennifer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.22,1:02:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.10,1:02:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她临死前 我们四目相对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We locked eyes in the last moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.44,1:02:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,冰砸到她身上 她到底会有什么样的感觉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What did she feel as all that ice came crashing down on her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.95,1:02:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是忍不住想这个问题\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I can't stop thinking about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.16,1:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得 她的感觉和我的不一样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't think it's what I-- what I usually feel. It's--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.29,1:03:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我经常死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, I die so often...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.51,1:03:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你知道你会再醒过来的 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Because you know you're going to wake up again, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.35,1:03:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你死的时候就知道这一点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Because you die knowing that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.60,1:03:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.52,1:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我死的时候总是很害怕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I always feel scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.15,1:03:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡真的太糟糕了 我讨厌它\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's terrible, dying. I hate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.37,1:03:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,无论我死过多少次 都是一样的害怕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No matter how many times I go through it, it's scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.01,1:03:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,每一次 都感到很害怕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Still. Always, every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.43,1:03:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你还在\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.19,1:03:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,詹妮弗却不在了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And Jennifer isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.80,1:04:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你看外面\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.90,1:04:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙浩瀚无垠\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The entire universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.57,1:04:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她无处可寻\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}She's nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.59,1:04:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你看着不像是打印出来的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You don't look like you were printed out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.02,1:04:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是一个人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're just a person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.03,1:04:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是开放式关系吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are you and Nasha open?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.45,1:04:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.40,1:04:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 求你原谅我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, please forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.70,1:04:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和你亲热的这个家伙\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The guy that you're having sex with...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.75,1:05:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...that's not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.42,1:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's not me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.38,1:05:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个大混蛋 你碰她一下试试\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You motherfucker. How dare you touch her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.78,1:05:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,17号\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}17!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.58,1:05:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道迟早会这样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I knew this would happen at some point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.25,1:05:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你们两个站在一起\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, wait, wait. Stand-stand-- Stand next to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.50,1:05:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,把衣服脱了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, take this off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.17,1:05:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.00,1:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对 脱了上衣让我看看\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, I want you to look the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.98,1:06:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.61,1:06:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 你怎么能笑得出来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, uh, h-how can you laugh right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.28,1:06:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们两个可是多重身 我…我死定了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is a Multiples violation. I'm-- I'm as good as dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.03,1:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别扫兴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.80,1:06:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这种机会可太难得了 想想看 如果有两个我的话\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}When else am I gonna get this chance? I mean, think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.83,1:06:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你会不会也很兴奋呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You would be so psyched if there were two of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.29,1:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是"温和米奇" 而这位是我的"火爆米奇"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is "Mild Mickey." And this is "Habanero Mickey."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.72,1:06:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这太让人兴奋了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is so exciting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.39,1:06:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个真的不一样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's so different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.68,1:06:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 你也不一样了 你看起来很奇怪\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, you're different, too. You don't seem like yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.92,1:06:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.60,1:06:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个注射了奥施多福?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You just did Oxyzofol with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.90,1:06:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就打了一点点 还兑了好多水\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just a teeny tiny bit, with a ton of water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.20,1:06:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你要不要来一点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do you want some?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.20,1:06:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对 放松点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, yeah, relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.78,1:06:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别总是紧张兮兮的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.28,1:07:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.55,1:07:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人渣刚刚想杀了我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This piece of shit just tried to kill me earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.45,1:07:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这个房间 你看看 我都流血了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Right here in this room. Look, I was bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.70,1:07:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是你这家伙想杀了我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Like you weren't thinking of trying the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.09,1:07:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我都看见你鬼鬼祟祟的了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I saw you sneaking up behind me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.80,1:07:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 闭嘴 都闭嘴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, hey, hey, shut up. Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.30,1:07:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我坐下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.93,1:07:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 听我说\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.30,1:07:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在起 我会尽量给你们弄吃的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}From now on, I'm gonna feed you both as often as I can,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.14,1:07:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们乖一点 别打架\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}so be good boys, and don't fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.73,1:07:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,18号说你们已经商量好了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now, 18 tells me you guys have sorted it out already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.45,1:07:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,食物对半分 工作对半分\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Eat half, work half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.80,1:07:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,按照奇偶数 轮流死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Alternating deaths, evens and odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.66,1:07:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这个方法真不错\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's a great system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.30,1:07:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,都谈妥了 大家都放松点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Negotiation done, so everyone just chill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.83,1:07:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.57,1:08:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以先出去一下吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Can you leave us alone for a second?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.70,1:08:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 有什么问题吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why? What's the problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.99,1:08:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我走行了吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}God damn it, I'm leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.12,1:08:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你真孩子气 这家伙需要来点奥施多福\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, you're such a baby. This guy needs some Oxyzofol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.16,1:08:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You can relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.78,1:09:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是门响了吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Is that the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.51,1:09:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.26,1:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,卡伊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Kai!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.39,1:09:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我们聊聊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait up, let's talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.73,1:09:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你想聊什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And talk about what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.40,1:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不关心你的私生活\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't care about your private life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.30,1:09:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 行 不过你有事吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay. Fine. But what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.65,1:09:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这么着急要去哪里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's the rush? Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.10,1:09:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才亲眼看到有人违反多重身的规定\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I just witnessed a Multiples violation with my own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.50,1:09:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,身为特工 我有责任报上去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}As an agent, I have a duty to report it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.37,1:09:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 行\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.00,1:09:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你什么时候开始来找米奇了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But since when have you been coming to Mickey's room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.59,1:09:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是第一次来 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is your first time, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.34,1:10:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你和卡伊是什么情况 她怎么来了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's up with you and Kai, bro? Why was she here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.80,1:10:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 我们现在该怎么办\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, man. What are we supposed to do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.47,1:10:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她会直接去找马歇尔\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}She's gonna go straight to Marshall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.10,1:10:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,举报我们的 对不对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and report us, isn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.10,1:10:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你先别慌 纳莎在处理了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You need to relax. Nasha's handling it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.77,1:10:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是什么事 就没有她搞不定的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}She can convince anybody of anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.90,1:10:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她可厉害了 再说了...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, my God. Besides...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.36,1:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个智障正忙着张罗他的小丑秀呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}this moron is busy with his clown show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.80,1:10:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊 它们在尘埃中漂泊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...who wander in the dust and lay them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.08,1:10:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,最终化作了这块风华绝代 刚毅雄壮 英俊非凡 魅力无穷\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}on this beautiful, manly, handsome, hunking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.00,1:10:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这个混蛋 真是个爱出风头的贱骨头\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This fucker. Such an attention whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.96,1:10:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,惊艳四座的石头\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...oozing with charisma... rock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.63,1:10:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋晚餐给你吃什么了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And what did that asshole serve for dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.85,1:10:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吃吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Was it good at least?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.22,1:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你真想知道 晚餐时发生了什么吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You really wanna know what went down at that dinner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.18,1:10:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 胸口上写了17的那个米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, the one with 17 on his chest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.02,1:10:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就是刚刚在我房间里的那个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that's the Mickey that was in my room just before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.50,1:10:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.82,1:11:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而刚刚跟你搞在一起的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And the one you were grabbing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.90,1:11:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他是18号吧?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's 18, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.50,1:11:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.12,1:11:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.65,1:11:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,18号归你 17号归我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You can have 18, and I'll take 17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.91,1:11:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.72,1:11:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,一共有两个米奇 一人一个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There's two of them. Why not share?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.45,1:11:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好 让我捋一捋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, let me get this straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.30,1:11:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时倒在地板上 拉裤子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You were shitting your pants on the floor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.39,1:11:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他朝你走了过来 在你脖子上扎了一针?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and he comes up and stabs you in the neck with a syringe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.65,1:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是这么回事吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.86,1:11:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时并没有拉裤子 只是…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I wasn't, like, shitting my pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.11,1:11:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微吐了一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I was just puking up a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.35,1:11:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,重点不是这个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's not the point!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.05,1:11:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你一有机会 就对他动手动脚的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I've seen you rubbing up on Mickey every chance you get, you fuckface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.20,1:11:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我早就想好好教训你一顿了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You know, I've always wanted to kick the living shit out of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.95,1:11:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 纳莎 我这是为你好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, come on, I'm trying to be considerate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.70,1:12:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 17号 差一点脚踏两条船\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey 17 was about to double-dip,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.29,1:12:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}if you know what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.75,1:12:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他想换个人玩玩 其实 我们差点就…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Move on from you to me. In fact, we almost--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.26,1:12:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,脚踏两条船 给我闭嘴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Double-dip? Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.45,1:12:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇不是你能随便掰的小饼干\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey is not some cookie you can split in half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.50,1:12:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,17号和18号都是米奇 两个都是我的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}17 and 18 are both Mickey. Both my Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.35,1:12:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在马歇尔当众羞辱你之后\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, then after Marshall fucks you sideways,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.06,1:12:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有狠狠地报复他 有没有\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}you really let him have it, right? Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.90,1:12:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你都说什么了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.36,1:12:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他说 "谢谢你请我吃晚餐"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I just said, "Thank you for dinner."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.54,1:12:33.08,提示,,0,0,0,,没有我们的救世主
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.25,1:12:35.25,提示,,0,0,0,,我们的主
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.25,1:12:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You said what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.08,1:12:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"谢谢你请我吃晚餐"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"Thank you for dinner."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.57,1:12:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谢他个大头鬼啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Thank you for fucking what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.00,1:12:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢他 拿枪抵着你的头\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}For putting... ...a gun to your head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.76,1:12:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的脑袋打开花是吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}before he blows your brains out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.05,1:12:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你真是个怂包\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}God, you're such a little bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.70,1:12:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个废物\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Fucking loser!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.10,1:12:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得 我确实挺没用的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I guess-- I guess I am kind of a loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.00,1:12:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.98,1:13:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是这种人吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Is that what you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.90,1:13:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Huh? Is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.11,1:13:08.71,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 我们终获自由 ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.30,1:13:12.31,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 我们要去应许之地 ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.31,1:13:15.83,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 圣光笼罩中的白色海洋 ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.70,1:13:19.63,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 你的王国在我们眼前 ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.90,1:13:23.20,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 哈利路亚 哈利路亚 ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.00,1:13:27.10,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 我们以天选之心侍奉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.10,1:13:29.45,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪ 就在此地此时 从永远到永恒 ♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.45,1:13:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.20,1:13:35.65,旁白一,,0,0,0,,♪阿门♪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.65,1:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们杀了这个混蛋吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Let's kill that fucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.31,1:13:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小子老嚷嚷着要杀人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This guy with the killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.39,1:13:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这个也杀 那个也杀 要不全都杀了吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"Kill this, kill that. Why don't we kill everybody?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.36,1:13:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是不想去就待在这里看电视\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You can stay here and watch TV if you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.77,1:13:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.86,1:13:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是这个态度 我们什么都谈不成\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You can't negotiate shit with that attitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.33,1:13:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I mean, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.90,1:13:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,奥施多福吃多了吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're high on Oxyzofol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.20,1:14:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.29,1:14:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, what the--?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.58,1:14:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他…他把你的枪拿走了 - 枪?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- He-He has your gun. - Gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.46,1:14:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快拦住他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We have to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.10,1:14:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 他要去哪里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What? Where's he going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.38,1:14:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 到底为什么马歇尔指挥官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why? Why, why is Commander Marshall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.85,1:14:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要把这块美丽英俊的大石头切开呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}cutting into that big, beautiful, handsome rock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.78,1:14:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太美了 它光滑迷人 又很精致\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Beautiful. It's sleek, hot, exquisite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.70,1:14:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很精致\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Exquisite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.70,1:14:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这上面将刻上我们的名字\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is where our names will be etched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.95,1:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有我的 你们的 还有你的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mine and yours. And you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.20,1:14:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你的 还有你 还有你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And you! And you! And you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.04,1:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你 我美丽的伊尔法\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And you, my beautiful Ylfa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.63,1:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在场的几乎所有人 都将被历史铭记为\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Almost every single one of you will be remembered throughout history{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.00,1:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,尼福尔海姆最光荣的第一代开拓者\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}as the proud founders of Niflheim's first generation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.35,1:15:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的基石 黑钻石\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Our cornerstone black diamond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.45,1:15:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,美丽璀璨 纯净无瑕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Beautiful, shimmering purity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.94,1:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这块石头将成为尼福尔海姆的象征与丰碑 - 没错\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- This rock will become the symbolic monument of Niflheim, - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.32,1:15:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是独一无二的纯净殖民星球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}the one and only pure colony planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.20,1:15:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 独一无二的 - 尼福尔海姆\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- The one and only... - One and only. Niflheim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.33,1:15:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,独一无二 尼福尔海姆 独一无二的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The one and only Niflheim. The one and only!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.54,1:16:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰它\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, don't touch it, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.96,1:16:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它可能有传染病\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Maybe it's contagious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.00,1:16:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它有传染病\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's contagious!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.01,1:16:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,碰到它就会死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You touch it, you die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.47,1:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 米奇 - 大家快跑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Mickey? - Everyone run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.14,1:16:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别挤 别挤 - 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Stop! Stop! - Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.14,1:16:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别挤 快回去 - 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Stop! Go back! - Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.31,1:16:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,封锁出口 隔离这个房间\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Seal the exit! Isolate the chamber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.73,1:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,都冷静点 真服了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Stay calm, God damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.82,1:16:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快消毒\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sterilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.74,1:16:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,启动第一阶段 特工们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Initiate stage one. Agents!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.80,1:16:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快穿上防护服\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Into your hazmat suit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.85,1:16:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阿卡迪 - 我在\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Arkady. - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.99,1:16:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 动作快点 - 是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Move your ass. - Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.23,1:16:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住它\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Capture it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.82,1:16:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,给我抓活的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Capture it alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.13,1:16:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,它在这里 它在这里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's here! It's here! That's it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.93,1:17:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对 快抓住它\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.26,1:17:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住它 抓住它 抓住它\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Get it, get it, get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.60,1:17:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快点抓住 一群废物\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Get-- Get-- God damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.10,1:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,消耗体 你不用穿防护服\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, Expendable, you don't need a hazmat suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.80,1:17:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧去抓住那个东西\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Catch the goddamn thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.70,1:17:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我抓住那只该死的虫子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Catch that thing now, you idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.00,1:17:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Grab it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.04,1:17:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.88,1:17:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个米奇呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Where's the other Mickey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.67,1:17:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.59,1:17:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 快把它放进来 快\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, in here! In here. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.84,1:17:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 抓住了 抓住了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on, we got it! We got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.38,1:17:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 快拿枪\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, no, no. Take the gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.39,1:17:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 住手\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.78,1:17:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,多重身\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Multiples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.15,1:18:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪 我控制住他了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Don't shoot. I've got him under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.53,1:18:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Don't shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.74,1:18:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 冷静点 冷静点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes. Calm down. Calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.20,1:18:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,局面已经控制住了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We have everything under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.30,1:18:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你太酷了 马歇尔 太厉害了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You rock, Marshall! Bravo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.13,1:18:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那对卑劣下贱的多重身 毁了我们如此宝贵的…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Those lowlife Multiples have ruined our precious symbol of--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.18,1:18:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,弄死它\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Kill it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.10,1:18:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,您先趴下 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Get down, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.93,1:18:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Open fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.30,1:18:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我消毒\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sterilize me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.34,1:18:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,逮捕他 该死的多重身\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Arrest him. Fucking Multiples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.40,1:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉委员会 你是想打死马歇尔身后的恐怖虫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Tell the Committee you were aiming at the creeper behind Marshall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.03,1:19:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你就会被永久删除的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Otherwise, you could get permanently deleted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.62,1:19:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Fuck that shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.24,1:19:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你真以为那个老家伙能让我们活命吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You really think Captain Creampie's gonna let us live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.71,1:19:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能会亲自枪毙我们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's probably gonna shoot us himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.21,1:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个疯子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's a nutjob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.05,1:19:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,谁的话都听不进去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Doesn't listen to anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.50,1:19:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他是所有米奇里最疯最蠢的一个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He's the biggest, dumbest nutjob out of all the Mickeys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.30,1:19:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我真没夸张\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And that's saying something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.13,1:19:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我的人生都毁了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He screwed my entire life up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.76,1:19:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.00,1:19:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是我们被你害惨了 谁让你不去死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We all got fucked the minute you decided not to die{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.68,1:19:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还回来找美妞的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and came crawling home to mummy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.10,1:19:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这又不是我的错 是恐怖虫的错\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That wasn't my fault. That was a creeper's fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.47,1:20:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖虫?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Creeper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.10,1:20:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,本来恐怖虫应该把我吃掉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, if that creeper's eaten me like it was supposed to,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.28,1:20:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样事情也不会到今天这个地步\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}then we wouldn't be in this situation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.20,1:20:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它们把我赶了出去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but they all kicked me out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.45,1:20:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,害我成了多重身\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and now I'm a goddamn Multiple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.74,1:20:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把你赶了出去? - 是啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- They kicked you out? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.83,1:20:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,它们又推我 又拉我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They were all pushing me and pulling me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.42,1:20:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,最后把我丢回到雪地上\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and I mean, they all threw me back into the snow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.50,1:20:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可能我看上去不好吃 或者闻着发馊了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Maybe I don't look tasty enough or I smell off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.40,1:20:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.18,1:20:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可能加点酱汁就能吃了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Maybe if I was in some kind of sauce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.76,1:20:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.50,1:20:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说它们救了你?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're telling me they saved you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.81,1:20:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,想想看\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.52,1:20:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你本来应该死在那里的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You should have died in that crevasse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.80,1:20:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖虫救了你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The creepers saved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.72,1:20:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 照你这么说的话\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, yeah, I guess if you put it like that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.00,1:20:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,它们好像在和我告别\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}they were sorta seeing me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.10,1:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该感谢它们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Maybe I should have said thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.15,1:20:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.95,1:20:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得它们不是想吃掉你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't think they were gonna eat you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.40,1:21:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.00,1:21:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.10,1:21:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得报给科学部 恐怖虫会救人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We have to report this to Science. They save humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.92,1:21:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对 大家需要知道这一点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah. People need to know this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.41,1:21:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它们救了我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They saved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.73,1:21:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 梯子呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey. Where's the fucking ladder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.15,1:21:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该准备好梯子的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You were supposed to bring a fucking ladder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.15,1:21:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't know--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.66,1:21:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来 我来帮你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look, here. Let me help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.53,1:21:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,打住 你赶紧打住 我自己来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Stop. Stop, stop, stop. Stop. I'll do it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.33,1:21:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己下去 滚一边去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm coming down myself. Get the fuck off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.63,1:21:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.45,1:21:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, Timo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.21,1:21:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你来干什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.46,1:21:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还真是多重身啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You two really are Multiples, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.60,1:21:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你是原身 从你的这张臭脸就能看出来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But it's you. Yeah, I see it in that schmuck face of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.45,1:21:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的杰作 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're the one who gave me this. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.32,1:21:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,错了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oopsie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.50,1:22:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,来 拿着 你们一定饿坏了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Here you go, guys. You guys must be starving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.98,1:22:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 就知道你会来救我们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Thanks, man. I knew you'd be coming for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.20,1:22:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are you up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.57,1:22:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.30,1:22:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛 是这样的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, um, here's the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.80,1:22:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我得录制一段视频 然后尽快发回地球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I need to shoot a video and send it to Earth, ASAP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.96,1:22:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,视频 发回地球?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Video? To Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.20,1:22:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah. Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.13,1:22:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,要发给...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.63,1:22:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,达赖厄斯·布朗克\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...Darius Blank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.88,1:22:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,达赖厄斯·布朗克是谁\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Darius Blank. Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.30,1:22:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天在门口发现了这个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Found this at my door today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.85,1:22:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是手写的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's written by hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.10,1:22:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,字很漂亮\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's beautiful handwriting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.87,1:22:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是布朗克的合伙人写的?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is from Darius Blank's associate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.80,1:22:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对 他的合伙人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah. His associate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.60,1:22:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这个该死的合伙人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Fucking, his associate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.41,1:22:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 这是必然的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You know what I mean? Like, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.40,1:22:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那个特别能放高利贷的家伙\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Of course, the loan shark of all fucking loan sharks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.80,1:23:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,必然能想出法子派一个手下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}would figure out a way to send one of his guys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.87,1:23:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我们一路来到尼福尔海姆\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}to follow us all the way here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.87,1:23:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,来到我们此时此刻 所在的这个地方\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}to Niflheim, to where we are, right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.34,1:23:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这里离乌兰巴托有一百多万公里呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's like a million fucking miles from Ulaanbaatar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.42,1:23:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,懂吗 知道那里有多远吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You know what I'm talking about? Do you know how far that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.80,1:23:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"不论你现在已经凑了多少钱 我们都发现"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"No matter what pittance you managed to scrape together, we found"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.89,1:23:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"你汇钱到地球得支付星际汇款手续费"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"that sending it to Earth will cost you an intergalactic transfer fee."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.39,1:23:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"超过... 总金额的一半"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"More than... half the total sum."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.80,1:23:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这挨千刀的合伙人 我根本不知道这人是谁\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The fucking associate! I have no idea who that is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.40,1:23:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道这人是谁 是不是很离谱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't know who that is. Isn't that fucking crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.10,1:23:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"发一段视觉艺术作品"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"Send a visual work of art."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.90,1:23:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"一个记录死亡具体细节的视频文件"\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"A video file that captures the details of death."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.07,1:23:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看背面\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Read the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.10,1:23:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,上面说 至少要把尸体剁成13块\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It says chop up into a minimum of 13 pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.12,1:23:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,剁 看见了吗 这是什么啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Chop up? What the fuck is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.08,1:23:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,特写的事我怎么交代的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey! What did I say about the close-up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.58,1:23:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,特写更重要好不好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Close-up is more important, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.20,1:23:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你要把那台32K摄像机\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, take the 32K camera,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.75,1:23:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里架好 给布朗克先生拍视频\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and put it over here for Mr. Darius Blank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.30,1:23:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.14,1:24:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm sorry, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.35,1:24:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看到了 信里写得很清楚\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now, you see, it's all there. Right? In the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.44,1:24:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我录了视频发给他 他就能饶我一命\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}If I shoot this video, and I send it to him, he'll let me live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.69,1:24:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是不录 他们就会派人来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}If I don't, they're gonna send their guy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.15,1:24:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然后先把我给解决掉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and he's gonna kill me first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.70,1:24:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我能怎么办\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.20,1:24:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 我要是死了 就死透了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on, dude. If I die, that's it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.65,1:24:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是消耗体 他们会打印出新的你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But you're an Expendable. They'll just print you right back out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.70,1:24:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 米奇 我是你朋友啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Please, Mickey, I'm your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.33,1:24:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你就帮朋友这么一次吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, please, do this for your friend. One time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.01,1:24:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定得帮我啊 我是你兄弟\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You gotta do this for me, man, I'm your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.80,1:24:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.27,1:24:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,实在对不起\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.56,1:24:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,实在对不起\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.02,1:24:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.50,1:24:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,当初就应该趁机把这家伙杀了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Should have killed this guy when we had the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.85,1:24:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你就帮我这一次吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You gotta just do this for me this one time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.24,1:25:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我就这么点要求 实在对不起\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's all I'm asking. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.24,1:25:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别哭了 死混球 你让我非常不爽\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Stop crying, you prick! Getting on my fucking nerves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.30,1:25:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要不然你们两个猜个拳\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why don't you guys do Rock, Paper, Scissors, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.25,1:25:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们就对输的人下手\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And then we'll just shoot the loser, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.96,1:25:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不猜 行 射他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No? All right. Shoot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.42,1:25:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.30,1:25:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对 他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.50,1:25:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这我可没想到 以为你会选他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I wasn't expecting that. Thought you'd choose him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.84,1:25:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你以为软柿子更好捏 快\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, you'd think so, but the soft one is easier. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.43,1:25:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.60,1:25:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真是个蠢贱人 提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're a dumb fucking bitch, Timo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.41,1:25:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,假如你真就这么干了 那个谁也饶你了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}If you do this, and what's-his-face lets you live,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.41,1:25:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为就完了吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}you think that'll be the end of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.40,1:25:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我不会亲手把你碎尸万段吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You don't think I'll tear you to fucking pieces myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.20,1:25:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊 有什么大不了的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, my God. What is the big deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.46,1:25:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,把我处理掉好了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Aw, just take me instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.60,1:25:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,绑好他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Tie him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.23,1:25:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.20,1:25:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,把我剁了 不要剁他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just chop me up, not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.76,1:26:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你看他这样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.34,1:26:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就拿电击枪电了他一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Shot him one time with the Taser, it's like he just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.60,1:26:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他就抖得跟睡了一条电鳗似的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}boofed a fucking electric eel, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.90,1:26:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是呢 哪怕你把我整个人大卸十块\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But you can chop my whole body up into ten Mickey chunks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.98,1:26:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能像最新鲜的生鱼片一样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and I'll still be fresh as the freshest sashimi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.36,1:26:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,昂首挺胸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Head held high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.99,1:26:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,达赖厄斯绝对爱看\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Darius will love that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.99,1:26:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只求你帮我个小忙\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I just need a little of your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.03,1:26:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,帮忙?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}My help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.70,1:26:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.66,1:26:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一点 奥施多福\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I kinda need more of that... Oxyzofol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.30,1:26:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,行 我这里有一些\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, I got some Oxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.50,1:26:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但我要没稀释的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But undiluted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.92,1:26:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You want--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.22,1:26:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在想要没稀释的奥施多福?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You want undiluted Oxy right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.55,1:26:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.51,1:26:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就当这是 就当这是...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Just think of it as the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.43,1:26:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,给临刑的人...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Think of it as the final...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.65,1:26:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,递最后一根烟\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}cigarette before execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.44,1:26:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友嘛 这是最起码的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's the least you could do for a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.50,1:27:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把你的给他 - 什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Give him yours. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.61,1:27:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点  - 不\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Come on. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.28,1:27:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,下回免费送你 我的为人你了解\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'll give you a freebie next time. You know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.70,1:27:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西可贵了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This was expensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.62,1:27:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,拿钥匙\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.76,1:27:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.35,1:27:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,别杀他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.73,1:27:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.61,1:27:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 你在干什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.28,1:27:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了这是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.70,1:27:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 别动\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha. Stay put.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.26,1:27:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,当时我的确吓了一跳\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That did kind of shock me a bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.30,1:27:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 纳莎是真的想用电锯锯掉提莫的脑袋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I mean, she literally was gonna cut his head off with a chain saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.21,1:28:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不过在这之后 我想了想 觉得感动极了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, but then, I thought about it, and I was so... touched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.63,1:28:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只有她一个人会为了我如此抓狂\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}She's the only person who'd ever lose it like that over me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.80,1:28:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她也不是第一次这样了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And it wasn't the first time either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.89,1:28:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 有事吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hello? Can we help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.48,1:28:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 走吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, just go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.94,1:28:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把防护服脱了 - 嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Take it off. - Hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.03,1:28:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要进去 - 干什么 快脱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- I need to go in there. - What are you doing? Take it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.54,1:28:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就进去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I am going in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.48,1:28:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你们把他一个人丢在那里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You've left him in there alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.53,1:28:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可这是他的工作\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But that's his job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.99,1:28:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这我才不管呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't care if it's his job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.57,1:28:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 我要叫安保了 我也不知道其他的...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, look, I'm gonna call security. I don't know what else--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.55,1:28:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是安保 把防护服给我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I am security! Give me the suit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.00,1:28:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,比个三 比三 比三\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Threes, threes, threes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.62,1:28:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 阿卡迪3.0 - 对对对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Arkady 3.0. - Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.30,1:28:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.69,1:29:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 是唯一一个对我不离不弃的人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, she's the only one who's always been there for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.95,1:29:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直爱着我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}She's always loved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.55,1:29:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,爱每一个我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Every me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.83,1:29:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,连他都爱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Even him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.07,1:29:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那个我完全不了解的我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The me I don't understand at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.15,1:29:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 你还不知道呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- What is this? - Oh, you don't know about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.40,1:29:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在外头兜了一宿圈子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They've been circling the whole night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.21,1:29:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还有来的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And still more coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.38,1:29:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在干什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.72,1:29:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 它们能突破坚冰和石头\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We don't know. They can break through solid ice and stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.80,1:29:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,假如它们都冲着飞船来 就太可怕了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Imagine if they all come for this ship. Terrifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.30,1:29:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可它在自助餐厅里 连袋子都咬不破\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But it couldn't even tear through the sack at the cafeteria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.35,1:29:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗 是昨天抓到的那只虫子在叫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You hear that? It's coming from the one we captured yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.10,1:29:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别听了 往前走 往前走\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Keep going, keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.27,1:29:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是那只虫宝宝\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, what-- You mean, the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.80,1:29:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 它像婴儿一样又叫又闹\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, yeah, it's been screaming and crying like one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.60,1:29:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,然后这些虫子就开始聚集了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And that's when they all started gathering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.45,1:29:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.32,1:29:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 米奇 不要停\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Hey. - Mickey, don't stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.92,1:29:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那只...那只虫子是...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That was-- That was the one that I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.10,1:29:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,走了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.10,1:29:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.30,1:30:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hi! How ya doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.70,1:30:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.42,1:30:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 借过\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sorry, passing through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.60,1:30:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为什么要把战情室设在那里?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey. Why did they set up the Situation Room there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.38,1:30:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 他们只让我带囚犯过去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Beats me. I was just told to bring the prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.18,1:30:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,伊尔法显然是大闹了一场\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Apparently, Ylfa made a big scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.76,1:30:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她现在就要见这条虫子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}She wants the creeper now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.55,1:30:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,多萝西 我有关于恐怖虫的重要信息\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Dorothy, I have crucial information about the creepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.10,1:30:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇需要给科学部负责人交一份正式报告\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey needs to file an official report with the head of Science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.40,1:30:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.90,1:30:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我就知道\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes. I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.66,1:30:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天 你在自助餐厅抓到虫宝宝的时候 我看到了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yesterday, at the cafeteria, when you held onto the baby, I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.83,1:30:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You saw that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.20,1:30:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不明白意思\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't know what it means, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.60,1:30:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是在模仿\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh. So, you're just imitating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.62,1:30:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本呢...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, originally, I--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.75,1:30:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,多萝西 赶紧的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Dorothy, look alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.25,1:30:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,现在实在是太乱了 回头再聊吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's really hectic right now. Let's talk later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.10,1:30:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在录制它们的声音\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We're recording their sounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.30,1:30:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看能不能分析出规律\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}to see if we can analyze any kind of pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.40,1:30:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,委员会宣布进入三级紧急状态\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The Committee is declaring a level three emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.00,1:30:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,马歇尔指挥官以36票对21票获得了唯一指挥权\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sole commanding control has been granted to Commander Marshall by a vote of 36 to 21.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.27,1:31:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.98,1:31:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 这食材绝对新奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What an event. This is a truly novel ingredient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.32,1:31:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,它开辟了一个全新的酱汁世界\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This opens up a whole new world of potential sauces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.11,1:31:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真个是好... 怎么说呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mm. It's such a great... How should I put it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.53,1:31:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好机会 夫人 对 这机会非常好 可棒了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Opportunity, ma'am. Yes, quite the opportunity. Just super.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.83,1:31:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 这机会可棒了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, it is a super opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.15,1:31:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是天赐的礼物\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's such a godsend, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.84,1:31:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这里面没有有害的病原体吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It is free from harmful pathogens, correct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.97,1:31:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对 夫人 当然\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, ma'am, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.00,1:32:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个蠢货是米奇18号\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Which dickhead is it? Mickey 18?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.30,1:32:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,按住他脑袋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Keep his head still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.42,1:32:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我能分清你们两个了 龌龊的多重身\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now, I can tell you two apart. Filthy Multiples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.51,1:32:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 这样确实好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, yeah. That does seem fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.05,1:32:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 肉都焦了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, goodness. Burnt meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.93,1:32:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这不算什么 亲爱的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, that's nothing, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.59,1:32:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等他们在循环站里变成焦香肠了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait until these two are scorched sausages in the cycler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.56,1:32:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那个味道你怎么对付\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How are you gonna handle that stench?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.10,1:32:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我在尽快弄呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm going as fast as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.52,1:32:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 真对不起\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.19,1:32:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个的记忆 都存在这块砖里 是不是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You two. This brick stores your memories, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.98,1:32:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就要眼睁睁看着 我永久性删掉你们了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now, you'll watch as I permanently delete your being from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.95,1:32:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这样 你们就能理解终了的意义和恐怖之处了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That way you'll understand the meaning and terror of finality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.62,1:32:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,以后就打印不了了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No more reprints!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.28,1:32:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们挂的时候应该想想 这个正在清空记忆模块\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's what you both should be thinking when you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.79,1:32:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,死透了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Dead forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.25,1:32:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,现在记忆已经没了 你们两个谁先上路\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now that the memory is gone, which body goes first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.08,1:32:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一次一个 乐趣双份\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One at a time is twice the fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.63,1:32:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,恶心\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Creepy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.38,1:32:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,马歇尔指挥官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Commander Marshall, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.84,1:32:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我能说两句吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}May I say a few words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.51,1:32:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不管先烧谁 都有一个简单的事实\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Regardless of who burns first, a simple fact is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.34,1:33:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们面前有两个米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}we currently have two Mickeys here before us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.60,1:33:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,补充一句 这不是他们的错\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Due to no fault on their part, I might add.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.83,1:33:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一个米奇被指控对您开枪 这是错的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One of them is being falsely accused of firing his gun at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.77,1:33:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 他是心系您的安危\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But the truth is, he was concerned for your safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.80,1:33:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他最先发现第二只虫子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}He was the first to notice the second creeper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.36,1:33:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,从您身后的石头里钻出来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}coming out of the stone behind you, and as you are well aware{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.10,1:33:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而您也清楚 一旦消耗体被打印出来...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}the day an Expendable is printed--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.45,1:33:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.70,1:33:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你还替这两个白痴说话\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You defending these idiots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.78,1:33:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,解释下你这堆破事吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Should be mopping up your own shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.65,1:33:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你非法持有奥施多福\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Illegal possession of Oxyzofol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.00,1:33:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,隐瞒多重身情况不报\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Concealment of a Multiples violation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.87,1:33:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让人失望\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's disappointing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.00,1:33:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,还有用电锯谋杀他人未遂\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And attempted murder with a fucking chain saw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.75,1:33:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,劣迹够多的啊 你说是吗 巴瑞吉女士\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I mean, it's quite the colorful rap sheet, don't you think, Miss. Barridge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.59,1:33:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,战争阴云笼罩着我们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mmm. The clouds of war are billowing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.88,1:33:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这群害虫吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look at those vermin swarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.00,1:33:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在这样的关键时刻 人类必须团结\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mankind must unite at this critical juncture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.38,1:33:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么还在这些败类身上浪费时间呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why are we wasting our time with these dregs of society?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.80,1:33:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,您讲话有真正的大将之风 长官 让人叹服\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Spoken like a true wartime commander, sir. Very impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.00,1:33:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And a fine entry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.77,1:33:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这席话可以成为您战斗语录里的佳句\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}to add to your collection of battle quotes, if I may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.77,1:33:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喜欢吗 - 是的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- You like that? - I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.02,1:33:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我再来几句 - 您说\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- More of that? - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.27,1:33:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,您一直说我们处于战争状态\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You keep mentioning that we're in a state of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.94,1:33:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我能斗胆讲两点观察吗 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}May I be so bold as to offer two observations, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.49,1:34:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你随便讲\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Be my guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.42,1:34:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,第一点观察 打仗要消耗大量的能量 还有卡路里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Firstly, fighting a war requires a huge amount of energy and calories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.60,1:34:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,鉴于我们处于殖民的早期阶段\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Seeing as we're in the early stages of settlement,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.66,1:34:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,而且生存处境十分严峻\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and our survival is in the balance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.55,1:34:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想 这样的消耗是否明智呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I wonder whether this expenditure is prudent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.00,1:34:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,第二点观察 恐怖虫显然是我们的敌人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Secondly, our apparent enemies are the creepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.42,1:34:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们真的清楚它们想不想打仗吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But do we know whether they actually want to engage in war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.15,1:34:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这么久了 它们只是在外面绕圈嚎叫而已\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}For hours they've been swirling in circles doing nothing but waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.20,1:34:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 巴瑞吉特工\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}My God, Agent Barridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.05,1:34:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前可是拿过五届马歇尔杯冠军的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You used to be a five time Marshall Cup champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.25,1:34:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还是 月度最佳特工\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"Agent of the Month."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.77,1:34:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,结果现在 你却因为这些外星虫子担惊受怕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And now, you're sweating over these alien insects?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.20,1:34:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真能堕落啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How far you've fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.91,1:34:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等它们在飞船上破开洞\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are you gonna do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.95,1:34:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,把你撕烂了 你怎么办\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}when they tear a hole in the ship and tear off your ass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.74,1:34:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这些丑八怪破虫子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}These grotesque shit-gibbons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.16,1:34:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,它们不论丑不丑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Grotesque or not,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.29,1:34:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,都是这个星球上的原住民\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}they are the native inhabitants of this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.70,1:34:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们能证明它们救了我们一个人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And we have proof that they saved one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.30,1:34:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,它们没有吃他 也没有攻击他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They didn't eat him or attack him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.63,1:34:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,救了谁 没吃谁\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Saved and not eaten whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.26,1:35:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.22,1:35:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,它们救了我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They saved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.06,1:35:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它们当然不吃你了 你难吃得很\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Of course they didn't eat you. You're crap food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.10,1:35:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就是一坨再生午餐肉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're recycled Spam baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.65,1:35:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你被一次一次又一次地弄碎 然后丢出去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You get chewed up and shit out over and over and over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.36,1:35:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我看这些虫子都不傻\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, I guess they aren't just stupid bugs, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.61,1:35:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它们知道要拒绝破烂垃圾\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I mean, they knew to pass on crap, junk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.07,1:35:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它们肯定是有一定认知能力的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They must have some cognitive ability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.07,1:35:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,完全正确\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.08,1:35:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 它们显示出了高智商的迹象\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Actually, they exhibit signs of high intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.70,1:35:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,或许 能进行有意义的对话\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They may be able to engage in meaningful conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.54,1:35:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在分析 然后...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And we're analyzing this, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.04,1:35:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 您一定要亲自试着和它们沟通\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sir, you must try communicating with them yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.55,1:35:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们目前正在研发一种 一种翻译机器\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We're developing a-a, um, a sort of translator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.80,1:35:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样吗 你当我是白痴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Like that, you mean? You think I'm an idiot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.87,1:36:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了四年半的时间穿越这个破星系\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Four and a half years across the fucking galaxy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.50,1:36:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了听这些该死的外星生物怪叫吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}just to hear these goddamn aliens squawk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.50,1:36:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们告诉我 这有什么意义呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Tell me how the fuck that makes any sense! Somebody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.21,1:36:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来说说 这有什么意义\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How does this make any sense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.52,1:36:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你干的破事又有什么意义\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How does your bullshit make any sense?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.51,1:36:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个无敌烂人 才是真的跟意义不沾边好吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Your fucking fuckface is what really doesn't make any fucking sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.84,1:36:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个大白痴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}you fucking idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.81,1:36:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你说它们是外星生物 其实我们才是 蠢货\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You call them aliens. We're the aliens, dumbass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.85,1:36:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是它们先在这里落脚的 而米奇...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They were living here before us, and Mickey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.22,1:36:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇自始至终都没有变过\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey was always just Mickey Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.10,1:36:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这是什么意思吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do you even understand what that means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.86,1:36:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在你这通瞎折腾之前\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They were just living their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.86,1:36:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都在好好过日子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Before you came in with your bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.15,1:36:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你还自以为手握生杀大权\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And you think you get to decide who lives and who dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.62,1:36:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个大笨蛋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You are a dumb fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.10,1:36:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪你当时败选了 你这个傻瓜\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No wonder you blew the elections, you fucking moron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.68,1:37:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要 快住手\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No! No, no. No, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.80,1:37:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你有病吧 你在伤害虫宝宝\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What the fuck is wrong with you? You're hurting a baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.88,1:37:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,咬住\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Bite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.87,1:37:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.58,1:37:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,松手倒计时 三 二 一\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Falling in three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.30,1:37:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,她可算是闭嘴了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Finally, she shut the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.01,1:37:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这摆明了是一而再再而三地施虐\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is clearly abuse, one case after the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.68,1:37:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,开始录制\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Rolling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.27,1:37:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,32K分辨率\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}In 32K.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.70,1:38:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一定都要录下来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Make sure you get everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.15,1:38:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 牙真结实 - 是啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Impressive teeth. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.65,1:38:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要更多的自己人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We need more of our guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.60,1:38:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 现在或许是我们开始全面灭绝行动的最佳时机\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sir, now might be the prime time to initiate Total Extermination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.61,1:38:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,光外面的那些虫子就已经够多了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The ones out there alone would be more than enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.12,1:38:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.60,1:38:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要用毒气 把它们杀光\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We're gonna gas 'em, we're gonna gas 'em all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.15,1:38:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是什么表情 对自己的失败没信心?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's that look for? Still not confident in your failures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.50,1:38:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是的 长官 阿卡迪3.0气体\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No. No. Sir, Arkady 3.0{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.38,1:38:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,先后经历过几个精密的测试阶段\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}has gone through several meticulous stages of testing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.63,1:38:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,它是终极神经毒气\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Arkady 3.0 is the ultimate nerve gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.77,1:38:31.00,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(192,250)}(致命神经毒气  阿卡迪3.0测试)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.65,1:38:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我有绝对的把握 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I have every confidence in it, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.50,1:38:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你就应该有把握 这事只准成功\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}As you should, Arkady. This has to succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.20,1:38:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我会一并祈祷的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'll put it in my prayers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.77,1:38:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直盼着这一天 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This is the day we've been waiting for, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.20,1:38:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,未来的历史学家会把我们消灭殖民星球\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Future historians will mark today as era-defining{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.94,1:38:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,危险物种的这一天 视为划时代的日子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}for cleansing dangerous species on colony planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.82,1:38:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,您何不亲自上飞掠机呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why don't you board the flitter yourself later?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.30,1:38:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放毒气的时候吗 - 对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- You mean when we spray the gas? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.40,1:38:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来扣扳机? - 正是 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- I pull the trigger? - Exactly, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.62,1:38:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果您坐在长机上 并摆出指挥行动的样子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}If you ride the lead flitter and appear to commandeer the operation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.30,1:39:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那我录的视频 就会有历史意义\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}the footage I get, it will be historic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.20,1:39:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那些在地球上的教会成员 也会仰慕您的...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And the members, the church members back on Earth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.65,1:39:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 绝对崇拜\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Huh? - They will adore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.79,1:39:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, yes, the company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.51,1:39:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 现在是时候开始全面灭绝行动了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All right. It's time we initiate Operation Total Extermination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.34,1:39:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,能跟你说句话吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Honey, can I have a word with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.59,1:39:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 亲爱的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.89,1:39:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个想法\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I've got an idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.27,1:39:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你们理解 我太太给了你们这两个烂人多大的荣耀\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I hope you both can appreciate what a great honor my wife is bestowing on you shit stains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.15,1:39:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说 我可以同时按下这两个按钮吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And so I can press both buttons simultaneously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.65,1:39:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 按下后两个炸弹背心会同时爆炸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, sir. Press them, and they'll go off at the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.07,1:39:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果离开了遥控范围 它们也会自动爆炸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They'll also explode automatically if they exit the range of the remote control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.66,1:39:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听见没 我攥着你们的把柄 所以别想跑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You hear that? I have you by the balls, so don't even think of running off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.62,1:39:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会给你们每人发放一件武器\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You'll each be given a primitive weapon as you head out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.70,1:39:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要尽可能多地砍断恐怖虫的尾巴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You cut off as many creeper tails as you can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.79,1:39:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,第一位带回一百条尾巴的米奇获胜\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and the first Mickey to bring back 100 tails is the winner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.15,1:39:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,赢的人能活命 输的人就会…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And the winner doesn't die, but the loser goes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.26,1:39:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在这里盯着你们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We'll keep score from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.09,1:39:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的任务就是让它们大声惨叫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Your job is to make them scream so loudly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.93,1:39:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好让剩下的虫子都跑过来救它们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that every last creeper comes running in to save them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.00,1:40:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一石二鸟之计 对吧 亲爱的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We'll kill two birds with one stone, right honey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.30,1:40:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 一百条虫尾巴\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Absolutely. A hundred tails is enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.25,1:40:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,够做好几年的酱汁了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}to make enough sauce to last a couple years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.10,1:40:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最好警觉一点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Better be on your toes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.11,1:40:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,走错一步 你们就成人肉汉堡了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One false move, and you're man-burger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.62,1:40:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.54,1:40:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是报应\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's all punishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.04,1:40:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.10,1:40:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人生就是该死的报应\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Our entire life's a goddamn punishment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.88,1:40:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,报应我五岁那年按下那个钮\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All for pressing that button when I was five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.81,1:40:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh. This again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.81,1:40:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那是汽车故障导致的意外 你知道的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Accident was caused by a car defect, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.66,1:40:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.70,1:40:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你按那个破钮没关系\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, it wasn't pressing that stupid button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.85,1:40:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,跟妈妈开车也没关系\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It wasn't Mom's driving either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.00,1:41:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟你说多少遍?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How many times I gotta tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.75,1:41:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 米奇 两位米奇 你们得出发了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sorry, Mickey-- Mickeys. You need to move, like now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.95,1:41:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,至少把坡给我们放下来吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Can you at least put the ramp down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.59,1:41:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,现在放不了 抱歉了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We can't do that right now. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.51,1:41:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们得自己跳下去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're gonna have to jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.72,1:41:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey! Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.31,1:41:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.15,1:41:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.52,1:41:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还没完工 但或许能帮你跟它们沟通\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's not finished, but it might help you communicate with the creepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.82,1:41:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.90,1:41:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意儿 是翻译机吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's like a-- It's like a translator thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.65,1:41:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对 祝你好运\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes. Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.36,1:41:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我个人感觉 马歇尔是不会杀你们的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}For what it's worth, I doubt Marshall will kill both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.49,1:41:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.36,1:41:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.63,1:41:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 那个 我...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Let's go. - Well, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.55,1:41:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,总之呢 有了这个装置 我得去做件事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, anyway, with this device, I got a job to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.55,1:41:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 它们救了我 现在我来救它们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All right. They saved me, now I save them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.18,1:42:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那两个废物在干什么呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are those fuckers doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.20,1:42:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我都能看出 他们放着几十条新鲜尾巴不砍\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Even I can count dozens of fresh tails they're leaving behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.43,1:42:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是不是疯了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are they out of their minds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.81,1:42:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 我要不要直接按按钮呢 - 嗯\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Oh, honey. Should I just press the button? - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.23,1:42:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就安心看戏吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Let's sit back and watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.54,1:42:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦他们意识到一个人 要比另一个人活得长\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They'll start chopping tails as soon as they realize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.26,1:42:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就会开始砍尾巴的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}one of them has to outlive the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.82,1:42:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.20,1:42:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 等一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's me! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.66,1:42:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你得赶紧跑 得带它们一起离开这里\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You gotta run away. You gotta get them all outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.79,1:42:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你得回你的洞里去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You gotta go back to your cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.09,1:42:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,回你的洞里去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Go back to your cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.42,1:42:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不然...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Or...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.64,1:42:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都会没命的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Or you're all gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.56,1:42:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.22,1:42:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.54,1:42:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.75,1:42:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对 那个 我想上次的事 我…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, I just, I wanted... About last time, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.00,1:43:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟你说 谢谢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I wanted to say thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.75,1:43:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得我吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You remember me, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.55,1:43:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.79,1:43:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我叫什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How do you know my name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.55,1:43:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.05,1:43:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 他们是在说话吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, are they having a conversation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.59,1:43:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 刚才我们已经解释过了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes. We already explained it just now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.60,1:43:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}How is this possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.26,1:43:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 它还是原型机\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, it's still a prototype,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.95,1:43:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但它就类似一个翻译设备\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but it's like a translator device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.59,1:43:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,多萝... 多萝西 坏了 她上哪去了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Doro...Dorothy? Oh, no. Where's Dorothy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.27,1:43:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,干扰太严重 我什么都听不到\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I can't hear a thing with all this static.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.90,1:43:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就连视频都糊得要死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I mean, even the video is shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.61,1:43:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官 外面的这场暴风雪正在加剧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Apologies, sir. The snowstorm is exacerbating the absorption--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.87,1:43:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那这玩意儿呢 引爆装置能用吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What about this? Will this detonator work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.49,1:43:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 它用的是特殊的短波信号 所以能用\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, sir. That is a special shortwave signal, so it'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.58,1:43:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那边那只大虫子是谁\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And who's that big one there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.70,1:43:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是这群虫子的虫后吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Is that the queen bee of the bunch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.25,1:43:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就像一块沾了屎的可颂\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mmm. Looks like a croissant dipped in shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.04,1:44:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,目前正式的报告还有待最终敲定\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, official reports are still being finalized,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.13,1:44:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们认为 虫群的一切都是以那只虫妈妈为中心\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but we think everything revolves around that one, the Mama Creeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.92,1:44:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说它是老大 跟你一样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, that one's the boss. Like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.32,1:44:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Say what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.06,1:44:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们得赶紧离开这里 不然...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You gotta get outta here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.10,1:44:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会用致命毒气杀光你们的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}or they're gonna kill you all with this death gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.11,1:44:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那种毒气 叫阿卡迪3.0 我中过这种毒气\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That gas, Arkady 3.0, I got blasted with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.57,1:44:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,它真的让人极度痛苦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's seriously, insanely painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.70,1:44:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,知道什么是毒气吗 毒气 就是…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do you know what gas is? Gas. Like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.10,1:44:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,毒气\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Like gas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.10,1:44:36.00,提示,,0,0,0,,你懂的...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.66,1:44:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,管好你自己的事 笨蛋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mind your own business, stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.55,1:44:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,管好我自己的事 那你呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mind my own business? What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.05,1:44:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要在洞里救他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why'd you save him at the cave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.93,1:44:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,应该杀他吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Should kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.12,1:44:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.19,1:44:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我... 我们很感激你 就这样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm-- We're very grateful. That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.44,1:45:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Then why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.52,1:45:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么杀路克\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why kill Luco?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.45,1:45:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,路克?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Luco?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.95,1:45:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,宝宝 路克\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Baby Luco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.83,1:45:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你们 打碎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You group. Shattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.71,1:45:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,血\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.76,1:45:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对 那个...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah... Oh, that's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.59,1:45:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是路克\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's Luco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.72,1:45:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们救了你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.10,1:45:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们杀了路克\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You kill Luco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.00,1:45:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那另一个宝宝叫什么 飞船上那只\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, what's the name of the other baby? The one in the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.62,1:45:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,佐克\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Zoco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.10,1:45:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也要杀佐克吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Kill Zoco too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.00,1:45:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果佐克死了 你会做什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What if Zoco dies? What will you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.55,1:46:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.65,1:46:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,全部\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.55,1:46:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是指所有人类\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You mean all humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.47,1:46:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 灭绝 - 怎么灭绝\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Extinction. - How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.25,1:46:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,简单\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.45,1:47:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,耳朵捂住\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Cover your ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.52,1:47:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但眼珠会爆炸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But eyeball explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.22,1:47:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,脑子会爆炸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Brain explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.00,1:47:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们所有人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.60,1:47:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.52,1:47:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.30,1:47:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.05,1:47:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 快看我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha! Look at me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.62,1:47:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看我口型\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look at my mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.40,1:47:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么了 他怎么了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's wrong with them? What's wrong with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.00,1:47:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在说话 那白痴说什么呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And they're saying something. What is that idiot saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.32,1:47:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他用的 不是手语\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's not sign language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.99,1:47:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,C 3
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.07,1:47:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,C 3
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.70,1:48:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,C…3?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.04,1:48:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,3?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.37,1:48:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,C3 这是什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}C3? What's C3?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.70,1:48:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,C3?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.78,1:48:14.15,提示,,0,0,0,,(把宝宝带来)
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.10,1:48:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,把宝宝带来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Bring the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.93,1:48:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把宝宝带来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Bring the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.70,1:48:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把宝宝带来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Bring the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.18,1:48:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不把它送回来 我们都得死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}If we don't bring her back, we're all gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.40,1:48:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我有点不爽\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Honey, this doesn't sit well with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.06,1:48:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么那两个废物在跟虫子老大聊天\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Why are those two losers chatting with the boss of the bugs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.98,1:48:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以为自己能代表人类去谈判吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}They think they're negotiating on behalf of mankind-- humankind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.07,1:48:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是您站在那里 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You should be standing out there, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.30,1:48:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,迎接这一历史性的时刻\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}ushering in this historic moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.70,1:48:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是 两个老大在漫天的风雪中面对面地交涉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're seeing two bosses meeting face to face in a climactic snowstorm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.00,1:48:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,上演决定性一刻\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A moment of destiny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.29,1:48:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,您只管出去就行\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All you have to do is go out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.10,1:48:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我能创造出经典的场景\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I know I can create an iconic scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.25,1:48:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这会是尼福尔海姆殖民地 历史上的决定性时刻\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A decisive moment in the history of the Niflheim settlement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.63,1:48:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把宝宝带来 - 我都能想象出画面了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Bring the baby. - I can picture it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.88,1:48:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大教堂的墙和天花板弄得漂漂亮亮的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Adorning the ceiling and the walls of the grand chapel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.00,1:48:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 夫人 没错\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, ma'am, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.64,1:49:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一步呢 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And one final touch, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.90,1:49:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得您先去给它们讲话\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I think it would be great if you give them a message{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.20,1:49:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再放毒气 会特别好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}before spraying the gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.85,1:49:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,讲话?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A message?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.30,1:49:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果您不去讲话 今天的行动就会变成\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Without such poignancy, today would be a third-rate carnival{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.30,1:49:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一场用廉价杀虫剂杀蟑螂的三流狂欢节\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}where we spray cheap pesticide over cockroaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.78,1:49:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 它们是恶心、肮脏、邪恶的虫子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, they are disgusting, filthy, evil insects,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.90,1:49:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但这会是它们生命的终点\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but it will be their last moment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.20,1:49:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,您可以送出一番仁慈之语\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and you could offer them a few merciful words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.00,1:49:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好好和它们道别 就像睿智慈爱的牧师那样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}as a proper farewell, like a wise, benevolent priest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.95,1:49:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拉一个摄制组\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Get me a camera crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.20,1:49:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,让第一队全副武装来见我\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Tell the first squad to meet me fully armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.13,1:49:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.88,1:49:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 战情室就交给你了 后会有期\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}My love, the Situation Room is yours. Till we meet again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.01,1:49:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,C3 纳莎会懂的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}C3. Nasha will know what it means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.50,1:49:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这事说来话长\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's a whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.93,1:49:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把佐克平安带回来 我是认真的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm gonna get Zoco back safe. I mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.15,1:49:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.98,1:49:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还要什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.86,1:49:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失去路克\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We lose Luco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.05,1:49:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.00,1:50:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,公平\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Be fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.62,1:50:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,公平? 我们要拿一条命来抵?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Be fair? Like we have to contribute a death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.22,1:50:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.50,1:50:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,公平\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.50,1:50:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有一个 要死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One of yours. Die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.80,1:50:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那如果我们把佐克平安带回来 再还一条人命\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, if we bring back Zoco safe, and a human dies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.90,1:50:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,和平\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.03,1:50:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.00,1:50:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.20,1:50:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,摄影组 三小队 能听到吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Camera crew, unit three, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.46,1:50:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 无线电信号有点不稳定\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, the radio signal's a little patchy right now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.80,1:51:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,车载扬声器会是我们的直接通信线路\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}so the car speaker will be our direct line of comms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.72,1:51:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,二小队 能听到吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Unit two, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.10,1:51:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们奉命护送马歇尔指挥官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Our orders are to safely escort Commander Marshall--{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.40,1:51:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没让你们开火 你们不要去激怒那些恐怖虫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No one told you to shoot! Do not agitate the creepers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.90,1:51:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别喊了 我们不是来拍你的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Pipe down. We're not here to film you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.45,1:51:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,非常棒\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Really great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.55,1:51:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 长官 您讲完以后\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, right after your speech, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.74,1:51:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会立刻拉上顶篷\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}we'll close the canopy at once,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.50,1:51:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这是让空中小队释放神经毒气的信号\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and that'll be the signal for the air squad to spray that gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.07,1:51:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,场面一定会很壮观 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Glorious annihilation, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.13,1:51:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你 过来 你叫什么 马修?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You. Yes, you. Come here, what's your name? Matthew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.26,1:51:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,马修 你长得像个天使 来 尝尝我的酱汁\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, Matthew, you have the face of an angel. Here, try my sauce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.15,1:51:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着 告诉我感想\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}There you go. Tell me what you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.47,1:51:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh! Nasha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.81,1:51:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 快住手\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No! No! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.52,1:51:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 她的脊椎会断的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hold! She's primed for spinal fracture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.60,1:51:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要扭断这个贱人的脖子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm gonna break this bitch's neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.81,1:51:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 别激动 别激动\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, no, no. Take it easy. Take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.60,1:52:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只要一扭 她立刻就没命\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One snap and it's instant death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.50,1:52:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎·巴瑞吉 你有什么要求\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha Barridge, what do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.10,1:52:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,虫宝宝 得把它交给虫妈妈\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The baby. We have to take it to the mama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.50,1:52:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这个?  - 对\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- That's all? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.60,1:52:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你得让我们平安离开\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Guarantee us a safe exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.80,1:52:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你想看我扭断她脖子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Unless you wanna see me break her neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.38,1:52:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别 纳莎 别这样\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No. Nasha, please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.70,1:52:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我们按谈好的条件让纳莎离开\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look, we secure Nasha's exit, as negotiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.80,1:52:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 你能小心放开她吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, can you release her carefully?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.30,1:52:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我去抱虫宝宝 小心\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm gonna get the baby. Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.02,1:52:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 你没事吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.85,1:52:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我得赶紧走 能给我架飞掠机吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I need to hurry. Can I get a flitter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.90,1:52:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕不行 你得自己跑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I doubt it. You'll have to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.10,1:52:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,逮捕那个臭婆娘\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Arrest that fucking bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.70,1:52:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,夫人 今天您和指挥官不断口出污言秽语\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Ma'am, today you and the commander have displayed an impressive range of verbal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.54,1:52:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,并做出远远超出自身职权范围的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and physical abuse and acts of cruelty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.79,1:52:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,肉体虐待与残暴之举\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that far exceed your granted authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.62,1:52:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你想因为叛变而被处决吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You wanna be executed for mutiny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.13,1:53:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所有证明你们施虐的视频证据\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All video evidence of abuse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.75,1:53:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,都将呈交委员会检视\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}will be presented to the Committee for review.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.00,1:53:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,建议您在听证会开始前准备好说辞\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I suggest you have answers prepared for your hearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.66,1:53:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 齐克\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Thanks, Zeke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.51,1:53:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,控制好现场局势\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Maintain control onsite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.44,1:53:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,等到离虫妈妈30多米远时\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}When we're within 100 feet of the Mama Creeper, sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.20,1:53:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会开始 慢慢绕着它兜圈子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}we'll start slowly circling the creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.20,1:53:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那是您开始最后演讲的信号\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That'll be the cue to begin your final speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.36,1:53:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.12,1:53:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,另一台摄像机会从外面跟拍您\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The other camera will track alongside you from the outside,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.16,1:53:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,把场面拍得壮观至极 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}making the scene absolutely spectacular, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.96,1:53:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让演讲简短有力\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'll keep my speech short and tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.54,1:53:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,精彩绝伦 无需剪辑\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A marvelous address. No need to edit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.16,1:53:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我就炸死那两个米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And then I blow up the Mickeys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.30,1:53:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,作为最后高潮(法语)\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Un bouquet final.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.68,1:53:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定能行\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You can do this, Nasha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.16,1:53:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会控制住飞船内部\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We'll get things under control inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.55,1:53:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 开门 - 好的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Open the gate. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.76,1:53:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回见 - 祝你好运\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- See ya. - Good luck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.36,1:54:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎会搞定的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha's gonna figure this all out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.93,1:54:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,佐克会平安归来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Zoco will be back safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.74,1:54:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.78,1:54:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Who's coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.20,1:54:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.48,1:54:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 怎么回事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait. What is this bullshit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.95,1:54:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哪只是它们老大\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Which one's the mama?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.08,1:54:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我演讲的时候到底应该往哪里看啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What the fuck am I supposed to be looking at when I make my speech?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.16,1:55:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,本来我想让它们有尊严地上路\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I was gonna send them off with some dignity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.38,1:55:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,现在可以让这些野蛮生物去死了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Now those barbarians can fuck off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.20,1:55:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 火箭筒能用了吗 - 能用 长官 正在装填\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Is that bazooka ready? - Yes, sir. Loading now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.55,1:55:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要把那个贱货虫妈妈炸得渣都不剩\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We're gonna blast that mama bitch into oblivion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.64,1:55:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谁需要这该死的演讲\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Who needs a fucking speech?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.89,1:55:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我要来硬的了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'll go hard, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.56,1:55:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,虫妈妈在那边 长官 能看到吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}That's the mama there, sir, can you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.75,1:55:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它的形状变了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It has a different shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.75,1:55:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对 是它 瞄准\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yes, it's her. Aim!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.86,1:55:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不是它 蠢货\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's not her, dumbass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.77,1:55:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.00,1:55:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.91,1:55:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎 纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha! Nasha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.00,1:55:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.51,1:56:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,该说再见了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Time to say goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.80,1:56:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.60,1:56:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,向离得最近的虫堆开火\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Blast at the nearest pile!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.71,1:56:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,从虫堆里杀过去 直到找到虫妈妈 干掉它们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Tear through them all until we get to the mama. Smash them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.55,1:56:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,摄像机 一定要拍下血肉横飞的画面\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Camera, make sure to get the blood and guts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.88,1:56:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 那边那堆\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait. That one there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.01,1:56:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,先打那堆 它比较大\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Shoot that one first. It's bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.93,1:56:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.06,1:56:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快开火 遵命\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Fire now! - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.50,1:56:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.48,1:56:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他穿着炸弹背心\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, sir, the bomb vest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.82,1:56:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,爆他头啊 大笨蛋\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Head shot, you fucking idiot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.48,1:56:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 长官 离得太近了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No! No, sir. It's too close!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.70,1:56:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,先等一下 站住 等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, sir! Stop, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.04,1:57:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么… 我的天啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, where-- Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.79,1:57:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.20,1:57:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.80,1:57:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你能搞定 虫宝宝没事吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I knew you would make it. Is the baby okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.09,1:57:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.34,1:57:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.30,1:57:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快看\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.00,1:57:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,佐克在这里 纳莎把它带回来了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We have Zoco! Nasha brought her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.80,1:57:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.03,1:57:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, Nasha,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.75,1:57:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,佐克它没事吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Zoco's okay, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.16,1:57:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.35,1:57:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Are you seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.25,1:57:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,一条人命\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}One human!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.33,1:58:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你也害怕了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're also afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.90,1:58:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你我都怕了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}We're both afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.10,1:58:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我是害怕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.20,1:58:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,说明你是人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It means you're human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.70,1:58:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你很重要\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.50,1:58:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来我这边吧 孩子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Come to me, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.30,1:58:50.30,提示,,0,0,0,,肯尼斯
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.50,1:59:20.20,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\pos(192,235)\b0}6个月后  春
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.68,1:59:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, guys...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.30,1:59:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 别不好意思 能坐下就都坐下吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Guys, don't be shy. If you could sit down. Take your seats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.82,1:59:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,奠基仪式将在稍后举行\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The groundbreaking ceremony will come later,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.52,1:59:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不过一会儿要先说消耗体的事\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but we'll start with the Expendable stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.69,1:59:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 米奇 到前面来 哥们\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey. Mickey, come up to the front, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.73,1:59:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能坐到前排来啊 你们这帮该死的社恐\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Could someone please sit in the front row, you fucking introverts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.00,1:59:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hello, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.75,1:59:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是委员会成员纳莎·巴瑞吉\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I'm Nasha Barridge, member of the Committee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.16,1:59:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,经历了数周的争论后\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}After weeks of debate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.33,1:59:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于迎来了这个重大的日子\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}we have finally come to this momentous day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.59,1:59:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 我们要废除消耗体计划\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The day we abolish the Expendables program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.51,2:00:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想在此感谢委员会各位同袍的支持\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I would like to thank my fellow Committee members for their support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.47,2:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我真切感受到了他们的关爱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I've been really feeling the love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.00,2:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是 大家一路奋战到底\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And especially, for fighting right to the end,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.40,2:00:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,并说服委员会 永久废除了人体打印\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and persuading the Committee to permanently abolish human printing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.48,2:00:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要感谢我们的米奇·巴恩斯\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I would like to thank our very own Mickey Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.73,2:00:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,说老实话 能和米奇白头偕老\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And to be fair, I'm just so fucking happy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.99,2:00:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是开心得要死\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I get to grow old with Mickey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.32,2:00:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,独自老去真的很糟 对吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It was really sucking getting old by myself. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.07,2:00:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,经过旷日持久的平和讨论...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Despite the hours of peaceful discussion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.41,2:00:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.83,2:00:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你来按这个\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So, you hit the button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.83,2:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 先等等\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}- Mm-hmm. - Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.04,2:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎会给你信号 然后你再按\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha will give the signal. You hit the button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.50,2:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等着 然后那里 会爆炸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait. And then over there, boom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.50,2:00:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我是得起来按还是 不 坐在这里按呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do I get up and press it or-- No, in my seat, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.40,2:00:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我真心不在乎你怎么按\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I honestly couldn't give a fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.60,2:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,今后 尼福尔海姆\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Henceforth, on Niflheim as on Earth,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.70,2:00:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,将和地球一样 将人体打印永久废除\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}human printing is now permanently abolished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.10,2:00:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 人体打印机将在这里被烧成灰\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Here today, the human printer will be burnt to ashes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.55,2:01:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,并从记忆中抹去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}and erased from memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.03,2:01:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎天生就是这块料\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha's such a natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.61,2:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得她甚至可以竞选下届委员会主席\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I think she could even run for Committee chair next election.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.03,2:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一想到六个月前 这个好女人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Blows my mind still to think that this amazing woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.62,2:01:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还跟我们一道在那座烂监狱里煎熬\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}just six months ago was rotting with the rest of us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.41,2:01:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是挺吃惊的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}in that shitty prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.54,2:01:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,马歇尔被炸成渣那天\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The day Marshall got blown to dust,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.70,2:01:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,伊尔法受了刺激 被送进了精神病院\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Ylfa went into shock and was taken to the psych ward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.13,2:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有传言说 她在那里割腕自杀了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Rumors went around that she slit her wrists there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.30,2:01:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,其余涉事者都被关进了监狱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Everyone else involved was shoved into jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.97,2:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的提莫获得了假释 免遭此劫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And somehow lucky Timo squeezes out on parole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.64,2:01:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可是他出来以后 天天提心吊胆的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But as soon as he got out, he spent every day dreading the moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.44,2:01:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,生怕哪天 会碰见送那封信的人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}he'd come face to face with the man who delivered the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.06,2:01:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,达赖厄斯·布朗克的那个合伙人 终究还是袭击了他\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}The associate of Darius Blank, who one day finally jumped him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.05,2:01:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一场生死决斗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It was a fight to the death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.82,2:01:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,最后...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}In the end...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.66,2:01:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那个合伙人 变成了循环酱\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}the associate became, uh, cycler soup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.33,2:01:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一只耳朵幸免\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Except for one ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.95,2:02:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,就连庭审的时候 提莫也是为自己辩护的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Even at the trial, Timo chooses to represent himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.05,2:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他用手揪住我 拿刀照着我的腹部位置 划了下去\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}As he had his grip on me, he brought his knife around to my mid-section right here, and he sliced...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.10,2:02:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他因为自卫 被释放了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And he got released on self-defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.31,2:02:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这很提莫\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Classic Timo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.47,2:02:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,而我们的审理 却一直没完没了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But our trials on the other hand, were never-ending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.30,2:02:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,达米安 坐下 坐下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Damien, sit down! Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.86,2:02:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,最后演变成了亲马歇尔派 与反马歇尔派之间的政治战\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Became a whole political fight between all the pro-Marshalls and the anti-Marshalls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.00,2:02:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过纳莎在那会儿就已经想好了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But by then, Nasha had made up her mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.90,2:02:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她想改革委员会 而且是亲自改革\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}She'd overhaul the Committee, and change it herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.13,2:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以她出狱以后 就真的去参选了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}So after she got out, she really did run in the election.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.70,2:02:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,并取得了压倒性的胜利\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}And she won in a landslide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.30,2:02:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在第一次集会上\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}On her first day in the assembly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.20,2:02:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,纳莎表现得特别沉着冷静\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Nasha was so cool about the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.00,2:02:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,当时 我可紧张了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I was very, very nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.26,2:02:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得她没注意到\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I don't think she really noticed, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.20,2:03:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 我把翻译机升级了 刚做出来\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey. I've got the upgraded translator. Just came out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.84,2:03:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好 来吧 能问个问题吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Okay, let's be fair, can I ask you a question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.26,2:03:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,问吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.81,2:03:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前说过\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What you said before,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.89,2:03:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要灭绝人类什么的 当时你们都…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}about extinction and all that, when you were all like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.10,2:03:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大声尖叫什么的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...and like screeching and everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.11,2:03:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那样真的会让我们的脑子爆炸吗\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Would that really make our brains explode?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.65,2:03:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,用声音震爆什么的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}From like the pitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.20,2:03:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,爆炸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.06,2:03:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你说…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But you said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.79,2:03:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的眼珠 都会爆炸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}...that our eyeballs would explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.79,2:03:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么炸的不是耳膜呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mmm. Why not our eardrums?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.26,2:03:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,因为 你们用的是声音\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}'Cause it's like sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.34,2:03:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,都爆炸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}All explode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.81,2:03:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真的?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.89,2:03:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那你能不能现场演示一下\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, can you try it right here? Right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.79,2:04:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,谁说只有人类会唬人的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Who said bluffing was only for humans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.75,2:04:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真得佩服这扑克脸\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Gotta love that, uh, poker face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.13,2:04:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那个嗝也很精彩\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Yeah and nice burp, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.27,2:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Uh, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.70,2:05:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这里干什么 这大半夜的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are you doing here? In the middle of the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.10,2:05:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个啊 我只是…\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Well, I just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.66,2:05:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你这段时间一直在住院\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I thought you were in the hospital all this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.62,2:05:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 看脚下 别踩到了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey, watch it. Look down. Don't step on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.46,2:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是无价的美味\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's a priceless delicacy, that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.34,2:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧的 蘸一点 尝尝看\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Go on. Take a dab. Have a taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.22,2:05:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 你都高贵得不能吃地上的酱汁了?\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Oh, what? Now you're too good for sauce off the floor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.18,2:06:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为还有谁会让你这种人渣\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You think anyone else would allow scum like you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.10,2:06:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,品尝这么好的食物\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}to taste something so refined?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.40,2:06:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是用什么做的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What is-- What is it made of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.45,2:06:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真无礼 不是这样的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Rude! Not how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.40,2:06:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你得先抱着信心去品尝 然后我再告诉你\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A taste of faith comes first, then I tell you what's in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.52,2:06:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 你该不会以为我让你品尝它\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey, you don't think I'm letting you taste this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.32,2:06:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为欣赏你的味觉吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}out of some high regard for your palate, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.37,2:06:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's the opposite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.05,2:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真正意义上的杰作应该是\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}A true masterpiece would be a sauce{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.37,2:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,连你这种无知的傻瓜都能喜欢的酱汁\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that could appeal to even an ignorant cretin like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.70,2:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,随你便吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Whatever. Fuck it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.18,2:06:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是尝是扔 我不在乎\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Taste it, waste it, I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.80,2:06:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经没用了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You're worthless now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.15,2:06:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还是把平常那位品鉴师请回来比较好\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Much better to bring back my usual taster,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.31,2:06:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那位真正拥有高雅品味的顶级品鉴师\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}the supreme one with an actually refined palate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.27,2:06:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这是...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Wait, that's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.94,2:06:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就连他的两个肾 都比你漂亮\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Even his kidneys are more handsome than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.66,2:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧 这不可能\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Not this. It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.21,2:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可能了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Of course it can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.38,2:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,承认吧 这就是你想要的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Admit it, it's what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.04,2:07:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也是所有人都想要的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's what everyone wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.72,2:07:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,伊尔法\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Hey Ylfa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.05,2:07:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起来了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I just remembered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.06,2:07:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你在马歇尔死后 隔天也挂了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}You died the day after Marshall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.71,2:07:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 摸我啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Go ahead, touch me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.17,2:07:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我是鬼 还是人\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}See if I'm ghost or human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.53,2:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我从小开始 就会做噩梦\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Ever since I was a kid, I've had scary dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.14,2:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这一次 我并没有怕\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}This time I wasn't scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.27,2:08:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在想\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I just thought to myself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.39,2:08:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,18号会怎么做呢\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}"What would 18 do?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.60,2:08:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你滚吧\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Fuck off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.36,2:08:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么呢 快按啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}What are you doing? Press the button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:14.11,2:08:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 快按啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey. Press it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.65,2:08:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,按啊\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.75,2:08:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,打印机毁了 我很开心 但...\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}I am glad the printer's gone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.90,2:08:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我心里又忍不住有点内疚\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}but a part of me can't help feeling guilty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.35,2:08:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我没有让其他的米奇有活着的机会\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}that I didn't let all the other Mickeys have a chance at life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.34,2:08:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不能再内疚下去了\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}But I have to stop feeling guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.30,2:08:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}Mickey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.00,2:08:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我是可以快乐的\N{\fs12\1c&H70ADD6&}It's okay for me to be happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.70,2:08:45.85,提示,,0,0,0,,(米奇18号)
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.60,2:08:55.85,提示,,0,0,0,,(米奇·巴恩斯)
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.90,2:09:00.50,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\fs12\fsp1.5\pos(192,212)}编剧与导演 {\fs16\fscy120}奉俊昊
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.90,2:09:03.80,提示,,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,550)\fs12\fscy120\fsp1.5\pos(189,202)}根据爱德华·阿什顿小说《米奇7号》改编

